<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite kulemba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba che Yohana chili chitabu chimo mu itabu ncheche mmalangano ga sambano yaikusala yankati umi u Che Yesu Kilisito. Chachili chose mwa yele itabu yo chikuŵilanjikwa “Ngani Jambone.” Yalembekwe ni che Matayo ni che Maliko ni che Luka ni che Yohana pakumala chiwa chi Che Yesu. Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba che Yohana jalembekwe ni nduna che Yohana mu yaka ya 90 pakumala kupagwa Che Yesu. Namuno chitabu chisyene ngachikusala kuti che Yohana ni juŵalembile, nambo ukotopasyo wa kulemba wo ulandene ni ikalata inayose i che Yohana yaani Yohana jwaandanda, Yohana jwaaŵili, ni Yohana jwaatatu. Malembelo gampepe ga chiikala gakusala kuti che Yohana ŵatamaga mu musi wa ku Efeso, kwapele ikukomboleka chitabu cho chalembekwe ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Che Yohana atandite kwa kukunguluchila pangasisa nningwa wa chitabu kuti wakamuchisye ŵandu kukulupilila kuti Che Yesu ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola, Mwana jwa Akunnungu ŵajumi. (20:31) Kwa kukulupilila yelei uweji tukukola umi mu liina lyao. Chitabu chi chilembekwe kuti asyome ŵandu ŵanawose ŵaali Ŵayahudi ni ŵanganaŵa Ŵayahudi. Ngani Jambone ji che Yohana kanandi ngajikwilana ni Ngani Syambone sine sitatu. Che Yohana alimbile nnope kulemba yankati yakusimosya iŵaitesile Che Yesu ni nganalemba kwakupunda yankati itagu. Indu ine yekulungwa mpela ubatiso u Che Yesu ni kulinjikwa kwakwe mwipululu, nginiilembekwa mu Ngani Jambone ji.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Yohana akutanda kujilemba Ngani Jambone (1:1-18).</para>
  <para style="io">Che Yohana akulemba yankati yakusimosya impepe iŵaitendekenye Che Yesu (1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">Che Yohana akusala yankati indu yejinji mu umi u Che Yesu iyapelechele chiwa chakwe ni kusyuka kwakwe (13:1-20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Mu liunjili lya 21, che Yohana akumalichisya Ngani Jambone kwa kusala yankati katema Che Yesu paŵakopochele ŵandu pakumala kusyuka kwakwe ni kuutanda kusala nningwa wakwe kwa kulemba chitabu chi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Liloŵe ŵatendekwe mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Chikanaŵe gumbikwa chachilichose jwapali jumo jwaŵilanjikwe Liloŵe, nombe jwele liloŵe jo ŵaliji pamo ni Akunnungu, nombejo ŵaliji Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Chitandilile kundanda Liloŵe jo ŵaliji ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Indu yose yagumbichikwe ni ŵelewo ni pangali ŵelewo nganichipagwa chachili chose chichagumbichikwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Jwelejo ŵaliji ndande ja umi ni wele umi wo uichenawo lilanguka kwa ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ni lyele lilanguka lyo likulanguchisya mu chipi atamuno chipi cho ngachikukombola kulisima lilanguka.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Akunnungu ŵantumile mundu jumpepe liina lyakwe Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />jwelejo ŵaiche kukwasalila ŵandu umboni nkati lilanguka lyo, kuti ŵandu wose apilikane ni kukulupilila. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Che Yohana nsyene nganaŵa lilanguka lyo nambo ŵaiche kukwasalila ŵandu pangasisa nkati lilanguka lyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Lyelelyo lili lilanguka lisyene, lilanguka lyalikwika pachilambo ni kwalanguchisya ŵandu wose.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Jwelejo jwapali pachilambo pano ni kwa jwelejo Akunnungu ŵachigumbile chilambo nambo ŵandu ŵa pachilambo nganiŵamanyilila. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ŵaiche kwa ŵandu ŵakwe nsyene, nambo ŵandu ŵakwe nganiŵapochela. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Nambo ŵanawose ŵaŵaapochele ni kwakulupilila, ŵaatesile akombole kuŵa ŵanache ŵa Akunnungu, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />aŵele ŵanache ŵa Akunnungu ngaŵa kwa kupagwa mpela ŵandu yakuti pa kupagwa ni ngaŵa kwa kusaka kwa mundu nambo apagwile kwa usache wakwe Akunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Nombe Liloŵe jo ŵaliji mundu ni ŵatemi noweji. Ni uweji tuuweni ukulu wao, ukulu wao jwelejo jwajikape jwatyosile kwa Atati Akunnungu, aguumbele umbone ni usyene.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Che Yohana nsyene paŵambweni ŵaasalile ŵandu ngani jankati jwelejo kwa kunyanyisya achitiji, “Aju ni jwejula junangambaga katema panasasile kuti, ‘Akwika mundu jumo kanyuma kangu jwali jwankulungwa kumbunda une, pakuŵa jwapali uneji ngunaŵe kupagwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Malinga ni winji wa umbone wao, uweji wose tupochele ntuuka wejinji nnope. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵagaichisye Malajisyo kwa litala li che Musa nambo umbone wa Akunnungu ni usyene ituichile kwa litala li Che Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Ngapagwa mundu juŵambweni Akunnungu katema kakalikose. Mwana jwajikape, jwaali Akunnungu jwausyene, ni jwakunonyelwa ni Atati, jwelejo ni jwatumanyisye Akunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utenga u che Yohana Ŵakubatisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Au uli umboni wautyosisye che Yohana, katema ilongola ŵa Ŵayahudi kutyochela ku Yelusalemu paŵaatumile ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi kukwausya, “Ana mmwe ndi ŵaani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Che Yohana nganakaana kwanga, ŵajitichisye pangasisa, “Uneji nguniŵa Kilisito Jwakuwombola.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Pelepo ŵambusisye, “Sambano mmwe ndi ŵaani? Ana mmwe ni che Elia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Che Yohana ŵajanjile, “Une nguniŵa che Elia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ni ŵambusisye sooni, “Ana mmwe ndi jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu jula juŵatite akwika?” Che Yohana ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ni ŵanyawo ŵambusisye, “Sambano mmwe ndi ŵaani? Nkuliŵalanga ichichi? Ntusalile tukaasalile aŵala ŵatutumile kukumbusya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Che Yohana ŵajanjile, mpela ila che Isaya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu iŵang'ambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Uneji ndili mundu jungunyanyisya liloŵe mwipululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Njongole litala lya Ambuje.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ni aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵalajiswe ni Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />ŵambusisye che Yohana, “Iŵaga mmwe nganimma Kilisito Jwakuwombola pane che Elia pane jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu jula, kwachichi nkubatisya?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Che Yohana ŵajanjile, “Uneji ngubatisya ni meesi, nambo apali jumo mwa ŵanyamwe, jwangankummanyilila. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ni jwejula jwakwika kanyuma, une nganguŵajilwa kuŵa katumetume jwakuugula migoji ja italawanda yao.”<figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Mundu jwawasile italawanda</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Yelei yatendekwe mmusi wa ku Besania peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani apala che Yohana paŵabatisyaga ŵandu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali Mwanangondolo jwa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Malaŵi jakwe, che Yohana ŵambweni Che Yesu aninkwaichilila ni ŵatite, “Nnole, jweleju ali Mwanangondolo jwa Akunnungu jwakwigala sambi sya ŵandu ŵa pachilambo! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ajuju ni jwejula junangambaga panatite, ‘Kanyuma akwika mundu jumo jwali jwankulungwa kuumbunda une, pakuŵa jwapali uneji ngunaŵe kupagwa!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Uneji nganinaamanyilila, nambo nyiche kukubatisya ni meesi kuti ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaamanyilile.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Che Yohana ŵatusalile indu iyaiweni achitiji, “Nambweni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu achitulukaga kutyochela kwinani mpela nguunda ni kwatula pachanya pao. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Uneji nganinaamanyilila nambo jwelejo juŵandumile ngabatisye ni meesi ŵaasalile, ‘Jwelejo juchimwaone ali nkutuluchilwa ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ni kwatula pachanya pao, jwelejo ni juchabatisye ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Nipele che Yohana ŵatite, “Uneji naiweni yeleyi ni malasile umboni kuti ajuju ni Mwana jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakulijiganya ŵandanda ŵa Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Malaŵi jakwe, che Yohana ŵaliji sooni ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaŵili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Paŵaweni Che Yesu ali nkupita, ŵatite, “Munnole, ajuju ali Mwanangondolo jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ni aŵala ŵakulijiganya ŵaŵili paŵampilikene che Yohana achiŵechetaga maloŵe go, ŵaakuiye Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵagalawiche, ŵaweni ŵakulijiganya ŵaŵili ŵa che Yohana achakuyaga ŵausisye, “Ana nkusosanga ichichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Ni ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Labi, ana nkutama kwapi?” Labi malumbo gakwe Jwakwiganya.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Njisangane ni ŵanyamwe chimmone.” Ŵakulijiganya wo ŵaakuiye, ŵapaweni paŵatamaga, jaliji mpela saa kumi ja ligulo ni ŵanyawo ŵatemi nawo lyuŵa lila.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Jumo jwa aŵala ŵakulijiganya ŵaŵili ŵaŵampilikene che Yohana achiŵechetaga maloŵe go ni kwakuya Che Yesu ŵaliji che Andulea, mpwao che Simoni Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Che Andulea ŵansimene kaje che Simoni mpwakwe, ni ŵansalile, “Tummweni Masiya,” yaani “Kilisito Jwakuwombola”. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Nipele, ŵanjawisye ku Che Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Ni Che Yesu ŵannolite che Simoni ni ŵatite, “Mmwejo ni che Simoni mwanagwao che Yohana. Sano chimmilanjikwe che Kefa.” Mchigiliki Petulo, malumbo gakwe, “Lwala.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwaŵilanga che Filipo ni che Nasanieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Malaŵi jakwe Che Yesu ŵapite ku chilambo cha Galilaya. Nipele ŵansimene che Filipo ni kunsalila, “Munguye.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Che Filipo ŵaliji mundu jwa musi wa ku Besesaida, musi uŵatamaga che Andulea ni che Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Nipele che Filipo ŵansosile che Nasanieli, ni paŵammweni ŵansalile, “Tummweni ajula juŵalembekwe mmalajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa ni mu itabu ya ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu, Che Yesu kutyochela musi wa ku Nasaleti Mwana ju che Yusufu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nombe che Nasanieli ŵambusisye che Filipo, “Ana chindu chambone chikukomboleka kutyochela ku Nasaleti?” Che Filipo ŵansalile, “Njise kunnole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Che Yesu paŵambweni che Nasanieli achaichililaga ŵatite, “Nnole! Jwele ali Mwisilaeli nsyenesyene, nkati mwakwe mwangali unami.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Che Nasanieli ŵausisye Che Yesu, “Ana mumanyilile chinauli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Akanammilanje che Filipo, nambweni ndi ntemi paasi pa chitela cha ntini pala.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Pelepo che Nasanieli ŵatite, “Jwakwiganya, mmwe ndi Mwana jwa Akunnungu, mmwe ndi Mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Ana mungulupilile pakuŵa nansalile kuti nammweni paasi pa chitela cha ntini pala? Chingawone gamakulungwa kupunda gelega.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Che Yesu ŵajendelechele kusala, “Isyene ngunsalila, chinkuwone kwinani kweugule ni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵa Akunnungu achikwelaga ni kutuluka pa Mwana jwa Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ku ulombela wa ku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Pagamasile moŵa gaŵili wapali ulombela musi wa ku Kana chilambo cha ku Galilaya. Ni achikulugwe Che Yesu ŵaliji kweleko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao nombe ŵalalichikwe ku ulombela wo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Pajamasile divai jiŵalingenye kwa ligongo lya ulombela, achikulugwe Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Nganakola divai!”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nkaasalila chakupanganya, katema kangu kakanaŵe kwika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Pelepo achikulugwe Che Yesu ŵaasalile achikatumetume, “Chachilichose chichansalile, mpanganye.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Pelepo syapali lulo syekulungwa nsano ni umo sya maganga, lwaluli lose lwakombwele kugumbala lulo sya mwana siŵili pane sitatu sya meesi. Syaŵichikwe pelepo mpela itite pakusyoŵeleka kwa Ŵayahudi kutaga meesi ga kuliswejesya kwaligongo lya kwapopelela Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile achikatumetume ŵala, “Ngumbasye meesi lulo syo.” Ni ŵanyawo ŵagumbesye ndendende. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Nipele ŵaasalile, “Sano ntechanje munjauchisye jwankulu jwa chindimba.” Ni ŵanjauchisye. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Jwankulu jwa chindimba paŵajipasisye divai jijaliji meesi kundanda, nombejo nganakumanyilila kujikopochele divai jo, nambo achikatumetume ŵala ŵaimanyi. Jwankulu jwa chindimba jula ŵambilasile nlombela, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ni kunsalila, “Mundu jwalijose kundanda akwapa ŵandu divai jambone ni ŵamalaga kung'wa ni kukolelwa akwapa janganong'a nnope. Nambo mmwejo ntupele divai jambone mpaka sambano.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Chelechi chili chimanyisyo chakusimosya chandanda chiŵapanganyisye Che Yesu mmusi wa ku Kana chilambo cha ku Galilaya ni ŵaulosisye ukulu wao nombe ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaakulupilile.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Payamasile yeleyo, Che Yesu pamo ni achikulugwe ni achapwakwe ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵala ŵatuluchile ku Kapelenaumu. Ŵatemi kweleko moŵa kanandi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Katema ka lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya Pasaka ja Ŵayahudi kaŵandichile ni Che Yesu ŵakwesile ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵaasimene ŵandu achisumisyaga ng'ombe ni ngondolo ni nguunda ni ŵakutindanya mbiya ali atemi.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Mundu jwakupanganya malonda ga kutindanya mbiya</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ŵapotile ngonji ni kuŵa lubokola ni ŵaaŵinjile wose paasa pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu pamo ni ng'ombe ni ngondolo syao. Ni ŵapikulenye mesa sya ŵakutindanya mbiya ŵala ni kumwasya mbiya syao. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ni ŵaŵaliji nkusumisya nguunda ŵala ŵaasalile, “Ntyosyanje pelepa indu yi. Nkajipanganya nyuumba ja Atati ŵangu kuŵa nyuumba jakusumichisya malonda!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵakumbuchile kuti, malembelo gakusala, “Alakwe Akunnungu, unonyelo wangu kwa nyuumba jenu ukundinisya mpela mooto mu ntima.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ilongola ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵausisye Che Yesu, “Ana chimpanganye chimanyisyo chachi chakusimosya chakutulosya kuti nkwete lilamulo lya kupanganya yelei?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngumulanje Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ji, ni uneji chindaŵe kwa moŵa gatatu pe.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Pelepo Ŵayahudi ŵala ŵatite, “Aji Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ji twataŵile kwa yaka makumi ncheche konjechesya nsano ni umo. Ana mmwejo chinkombole chinauli kujitaŵa kwa moŵa gatatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Nambo Nyuumba ja Akunnungu jiŵajigambaga Che Yesu jo jaliji chiilu chakwe nsyene. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Nipele Che Yesu paŵasyuchile, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵakumbuchile kuti ŵaŵechete gelega, ni ŵagakulupilile Malembelo ga Akunnungu ni maloŵe gaŵaŵechete Che Yesu gala.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akujimanyilila mitima ja ŵandu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Che Yesu paŵaliji ku Yelusalemu mmoŵa ga chindimba cha Pasaka ŵandu ŵajinji paŵaiweni imanyisyo iŵaipanganyisye ŵaakulupilile. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Nambo Che Yesu nganalilechelelaga kukwao pakuŵa ŵajimanyilile mitima jao <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />ni pakuŵa ŵaimanyilile uchenene yaili mmitima jao, nganasaka kusalilwa chachilichose nkati ŵandu ŵane.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukunguluka ni che Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Jwapali chilongola jwa Chiyahudi liina lyakwe che Nikodemu juŵaliji mu mpingo wa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Chilo chimo che Nikodemu ŵanjaulile Che Yesu ni kunsalila, “Jwakwiganya, tukwimanyilila kuti mmwe ndi jwakwiganya jwalajiswe ni Akunnungu, pakuŵa ngapagwa mundu jwakukombola kupanganya imanyisyo inkwitendekanya mmwe akaŵe Akunnungu ali pamo najo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Isyene ngunsalila, iŵaga mundu ngakupagwa kaaŵili, ngaakombola kwinjila mu umwenye wa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Che Nikodemu ŵambusisye, “Ana mundu akukombola chinauli kupagwa kaaŵili ali akusile? Akukombola chinauli kwinjila mu lutumbo lwa achikulugwe ni kupagwa kaaŵili?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Isyene ngunsalila, iŵaga mundu ngaapagwa kwa meesi ni kwa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu, ngaakombola kwinjila mu umwenye wa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Kwa chiilu mundu akupagwa ni atati ni achikulugwe, nambo akupagwa kwa mbumu, akupagwa kwa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nkasimonga pakuŵa ndite kuti nkusachilwa mpagwe kaaŵili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mbungo jikupuga kujikusaka, nkujipikana pajikupuga, nambo ngankukumanyilila kujikukopochela atamuno kujikwaula. Ikuŵa yelei kwa jwalijose jwapagwilwe kwa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Che Nikodemu ŵausisye Che Yesu, “Ayi indu yi ana chiikomboleche chinauli?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Mmwejo ndi jwakwiganya jwa Ŵaisilaeli ana iŵele uli ngankwimanyilila indu yi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Isyene ngunsalila, uweji tukuŵecheta itukwimanyilila ni kuŵalanga umboni wa itwiweni, nambo ŵanyamwe ngankusaka kuujitichisya utenga wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Iŵaga nantanjile indu ya pachilambo ni ŵanyamwe nganinjitichisya, ana nantanjilaga indu ya kwinani chinjitichisye chinauli? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Ngapagwa jwalijose jwajawile kwinani ikaŵe Mwana jwa Mundu juŵatulwiche kutyochela kwinani.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Mpela ila che Musa iŵatite pakulikoleka penani pa luchanamila lijoka lilyakolochekwe ni shaba mwipululu mula, iyoyo peyo Mwana jwa Mundu ikusachilwa anyakulikwe mwinani, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kuti jwalijose juchankulupilile akole umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵaanonyele nnope ŵandu ŵa pachilambo, nipele ŵantyosisye Mwanagwe jwajikape, kuti jwalijose jwakunkulupilila akajonasika, nambo akole umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Pakuŵa Akunnungu nganantuma Mwanagwe pachilambo kuti aiche kukwalamula ŵandu, nambo aiche kukwakulupusya.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Jwakunkulupilila Mwana jwa Akunnungu, jwelejo ngakulamulwa, nambo jwangankulupilila jwelejo amasile kulamulikwa, pakuŵa nganankulupilila Mwana jwajikape jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Lilamulo lili lyeleli, lilanguka liiche pachilambo nambo ŵandu achinonyele nnope chipi kupunda lilanguka, pakuŵa akupanganya ya chigongomalo. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Mundu jwalijose jwakupanganya ya chigongomalo akulichima lilanguka, ngakwika kulilanguka pakuŵa ngakusaka iwoneche indu yao ya chigongomalo. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Nambo jwakuukamulisya usyene akwika kulilanguka kuti yakuipanganya iwoneche kuti ipanganyiche kwa kwajitichisya Akunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni che Yohana Ŵakubatisya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Payamasile yeleyo Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajawile ku chilambo cha Ŵayahudi. Ŵatemi pamo nawo kweleko, achibatisyaga ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Che Yohana nombe ŵaliji ku Ainoni, pachiŵandi ku Salimu achibatisyaga ŵandu, pakuŵa kweleko kwaliji ni meesi gamajinji. Ŵandu ŵanjaulilaga, nombewo ŵabatisye. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Yeleyo yakopochele katema che Yohana nganataŵikwe mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Gakopochele makani pasikati ja Myahudi jumo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵampepe ŵa che Yohana nkati masyoŵelelo ga kuliswejesya kwaligongo lya kwapopelela Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Nipele, ŵakulijiganya wo ŵanjaulile che Yohana ni kunsalila, “Jwakwiganya, ajula mundu juŵaliji pamo nomwe peesi Yolodani, jumwaŵalasile ngani syakwe, nombejo sambano akubatisya, ni ŵandu wose akwajaulila.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Che Yohana ŵajanjile, “Mundu ngakukombola kukola chachilichose ikaŵe apegwilwe ni Akunnungu ŵa kwinani. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ni ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene nkumanyilila kuti nasasile, ‘Uneji nguniŵa Kilisito Jwakuwombola, nambo nalajiswe kuti naalongolele!’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Jwakulombekwa ali jwakwe nnombela, nambo nkamusi jwa nnombela akwima kuntumichila nnombela, nkamusi jo akusangalala nnope pakupilikana liloŵe lya nnombela ali nkukunguluka. Iyoyo peyo ni uneji ngusangalala nnope. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Che Yesu ikusachilwa aŵe jwankulu, ni uneji mme jwannondi.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwelejo jwakwika kutyochela kwinani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Jwakwika kutyochela kwinani ali jwankulu kwapunda wose. Jwakutyochela pachilambo ali jwa pachilambo nombe akuŵecheta mpela mundu jwa pachilambo. Nambo jwakwika kutyochela kwinani akuilongosya indu yose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Jwelejo akutyosya umboni wa indu yaiweni ni kuilipikana, nambo ngapagwa mundu jwakukunda indu yakuisala. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Nambo mundu jwalijose jwakukunda umboni wakuusala jwelejo, akwitichisya kuti Akunnungu ali usyene. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ajula jwatumikwe ni Akunnungu akusala maloŵe ga Akunnungu, pakuŵa Akunnungu akwapa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu kwa winji. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Akunnungu akunnonyela Mwana ni indu yose aŵisile mu ulamusi wao. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Jwakunkulupilila Mwana akwete umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi, jwangakunkulupilila Mwana ngakola umi, ni uchimwa wa Akunnungu uli pa jwelejo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni jwankongwe Msamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo ŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu akupata ŵakulijiganya ŵajinji ni kwabatisya kwapunda che Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Nambo Che Yesu nsyene nganiŵabatisya ŵandu, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni ŵaŵabatisyaga ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵatyosile ku Yudea ni kuuja ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mu ulendo wao ŵasachilwe kupita ku Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nipele, ŵaiche ku Sikali musi umo wa ku Samalia, pachiŵandi ngunda u che Yusufu wapegwilwe ni che Yakobo atatigwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Pelepo paliji ni chisima chi che Yakobo, nombe Che Yesu pakuŵa ŵapesile ni ulendo, ŵatemi mungulugulu chisima. Yaliji muusi lyuŵa pantwe.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Nipele jwankongwe jumo Msamalia ŵaiche kukuteka meesi. Ni Che Yesu ŵansalile jwankongwe jo, “Nguŵenda meesi gakung'wa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Katema ko ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe ŵajile mu mmusi kukusuma yakulya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nambo jwankongwe jo ŵatite, “Mmwejo Myahudi, ana nkukombola chinauli kuumenda meesi gakung'wa uneji jwankongwe Msamalia?” Ŵatite yele pakuŵa Ŵayahudi ngakukamulangana ni Ŵasamalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nkachimanyi chichi chakusaka Akunnungu kumpa ni ŵaani ŵakummenda meesi gakung'wa, nkammendile jwelejo, nombejo akampele meesi gagakwikanawo umi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Jwankongwe jo ŵatite, “Ambuje, mmwe nganinkola ngao ni chisima chi chilewipe nnope. Ana mpatile kwapi meesi gagakwikanawo umi go? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ambuje ŵetu che Yakobo ni ŵatupele uweji chisima chi, nsyene ni ŵanagwe ni ilango yakwe ŵang'wele meesi ga chisima chi. Ana mmwejo nkulitenda jwankulu nnope kwapunda che Yakobo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Jwalijose juchang'we meesi ga chisima chi chijakole njota sooni. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Nambo juchang'we meesi gachinaape une ngajakola njota ng'oo. Meesi gachinaape une chigaŵe nti meesi gagakuulika nkati mwakwe, gagakwikanawo umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Jwankongwe jo ŵansalile, “Ambuje, nguŵenda meesi go kuti jinangole njota sooni ni ninaiche sooni pelepa kukuteka meesi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Che Yesu ŵansalile jwankongwe jo, “Njaule nkaaŵilanje ŵankwenu, nkaiche pamo nawo pelepa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Jwankongwe jo ŵajanjile, “Uneji nganingola ŵalume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Njanjile yambone kuti nganinkola ŵalume. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Pakuŵa mwalombilwe kasano, ni jwannume junkutama nawo sambano jo nganaŵa ŵankwenu. Pelepo chinsasile cho chili chisyene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Jwankongwe jo ŵaasalile, “Ambuje, nguwona kuti mmwejo ndi jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Achambuje ŵetu ŵa Chisamalia ŵaapopelele Akunnungu mwinani mwa chitumbi chi, nambo ŵanyamwe Ŵayahudi nkuti, tukusachilwa kwapopelela Akunnungu ku Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Amao, nkulupilile chinguchisala, chikaiche katema ngamwapopelela Atati mwinani mwa chitumbi chi atamuno ku Yelusalemu kula. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Ŵanyamwe Ŵasamalia nkwapopelela ŵangankwamanyilila, nambo uweji Ŵayahudi tukwamanyilila ŵatukwapopelela, pakuŵa ukulupusyo wa Akunnungu chiutyochele kwa litala lya Ŵayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Nambo chikaiche katema, sooni kaiche, ŵakupopelela kwa usyene chiŵaapopelele Atati achilongoswaga ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ni usyene. Pakuŵa Atati akwasaka ŵandu ŵakwapopelela chanti yeleyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Akunnungu ali Mbumu, ni ŵakwapopelela ŵelewo ŵapopeleleje achilongoswaga ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ni kuumanyilila usyene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Jwankongwe jo ŵansalile, “Ngumanyilila kuti chaiche Masiya jwakuŵilanjikwa Kilisito Jwakuwombola. Pachaiche chatumanyisye inayose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Uneji junguŵecheta nomwe ndili jwelejo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Papopo ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe ŵausile, ŵasimosile ligongo ŵaasimene Che Yesu alinkukunguluka ni jwankongwe. Nambo ngapagwa jwalijose juŵambusisye Che Yesu, “Ana nkusaka chichi? Pane kwaligongo chi nkukunguluka ni jwankongwe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Jwankongwe jo ŵalesile lulo lwakwe palapala, ŵajawile mmusi ni kwasalila ŵandu achitiji, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Njisangane nkannole mundu jwasalile yanayose imbanganyisye! Ikukomboleka kuti jweleju ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Nipele ŵandu ŵakopweche mmusi ula ni kwajaulila Che Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Katema kakoko ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe ŵaliji nkwachondelela Che Yesu achitiji, “Chondechonde Jwakwiganya, ndye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Uneji ngwete chakulya chingankuchimanyilila ŵanyamwe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe ŵatandite kuusyana achinsyene pe, “Ana kwana mundu jwanjigalile chakulya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Chakulya changu chili kutendekanya chakusaka aŵala ŵandumile ni kugamalisya masengo gao. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ŵanyamwe ngankuti, ‘Jisigalile miesi ncheche, pakwika katema ka kugungula?’ Nambo uneji ngunsalila nnole migunda ji jili chile kwa kugungula. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Jwakugungula akupochela mbote ni akukumbikanya pamo magungulo kuti gakole umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi, nipele jwakupanda asengwe yalumo ni jwakugungula. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Chiŵecheto chi chili chisyene, ‘Jumo akupanda ni jwine akugungula.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Uneji nantumile nkagungule magowolo ganganimpande ŵanyamwe, ŵane ŵapanganyisye masengo gakulimba, nambo gelego ginkupata ŵanyamwe gali kwa ligongo lya masengo gao.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Ŵasamalia ŵajinji ŵa musi ula ŵaakulupilile Che Yesu kwa ligongo lya umboni wa maloŵe gaŵaŵechete jwankongwe jo gagakuti, “Asalile inayose imbanganyisye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ŵasamalia ŵajaulile Che Yesu ni kwachondelela atame pamo nawo, nombejo ŵatemi pepala moŵa gaŵili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Nipele ŵandu ŵajinji nnope ŵaakulupilile Che Yesu ligongo lya maloŵe gao. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ŵansalile jwankongwe jo, “Sano tukukulupilila ngaŵa kwaligongo lya kuŵecheta kwenu pe, nambo pakuŵa tupilikene twachinsyene, ni tukumanyilila kuti isyene ajuju ni Nkulupusyo jwa ŵandu ŵapachilambo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mwanache jwa jwankulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Pagapite moŵa gaŵili Che Yesu ŵausile sooni ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Pakuŵa Che Yesu nsyene ŵasasile pangasisa kuti, “Jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu ngakuchimbichikwa mchilambo chakwe nsyene.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Paŵaiche ku Galilaya, ŵandu ŵajinji ŵakweleko ŵapochele, pakuŵa ŵanyawo nombe ŵaliji ku Yelusalemu kuchindimba cha Pasaka, ŵaiweni yose yaitesileje Che Yesu pachindimba.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaujile sooni mmusi wa ku Kana, chilambo cha ku Galilaya, peuto paŵagatesile meesi gaŵe divai pala. Pepala paliji ni jwankulu jumo juŵaliji ni mwanache jwakulwala ku Kapelenaumu ko. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Nipele jwankulu jo paŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu atyosile ku Yudea ni kwika ku Galilaya, ŵajaulile ni kwachondelela ajaule ku Kapelenaumu akannamye mwanagwe juŵalwalaga kuŵandichila kuwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Ŵanyamwe ngankwakulupilila Akunnungu pangaiwona imanyisyo ni yakusimonjeka!”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Jwankulu jo ŵanjanjile, “Ambuje, chondechonde tujaule mwanangu akanaŵe kuwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Njauleje, mwanagwenu chalame.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mundu jo ŵalikulupilile liloŵe liŵasalilwe ni Che Yesu ni ŵajawile. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Paŵaliji nkutuluka, ŵasimene ni achikapolo ŵao ni ŵansalile kuti mwanache jwao alamile.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nombejo ŵausisye katema kaŵatandite mwanagwe kupata eja, ni ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Ulwele wannesile liiso saa saba ja musi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Nipele atati jo ŵajimanyilile kuti jaliji saa jilajila jiŵasalilwe ni Che Yesu kuti, “Mwanagwenu chalame.” Pelepo nsyene pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe wose ŵankulupilile Che Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Chelechi chaliji chimanyisyo cha kusimosya chaaŵili chiŵachipanganyisye Che Yesu paŵatyosile ku Yudea kuuja ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu pa litanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Payamasile yeleyo, Che Yesu ŵakwesile kwaula ku Yelusalemu ku chindimba cha Ŵayahudi, <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ni ku Yelusalemu ko, pachiŵandi nnango wekulungwa waukuŵilanjikwa nnango wa ngondolo, kwaliji ni litanda lyalikuŵilanjikwa Mchiebulania Betisasa lyalili ni mapenu nsano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ŵakulwala ŵajinji ŵagonaga mmapenu mo, kwaliji ni ŵangalola ni ŵakulemala ni ŵakutatala. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ŵalolelaga meesi gatinganyikwe, pakuŵa kapali katema katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵatuluchilaga mmeesi ni kugatinganya. Jwakulwala jwalijose juŵaliji jwaandanda kwinjila mmeesi gagatinganyikwe, ŵalamile ulwele uliwose walinawo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Pelepo paliji ni mundu jumo juŵatatele yaka makumi gatatu kupambula nsano ni itatu. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Che Yesu paŵambweni mundu jula ali agonile pepala ni kwimanyilila kuti ali jwakulwala moŵa gamajinji, ŵambusisye, “Ana nkusaka kulama?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Jwakulwala jo ŵajanjile, “Ambuje, uneji nganingola jwakunyinjisya mu litanda katema meesi pagakutinganyikwa. Pingulinga kwinjila, mundu jwine akuunongolela kwinjila.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Njimuche, njigale ugono wenu njaule.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Papopo pepo mundu jo ŵalamile, ŵajigele ugono wakwe ni kwaula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Yeleyo yatendekwe pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Nipele achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵansalile mundu jwalamile jo, “Lelo jino lili Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila ni malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa gakukanya kunyakula ugono wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nambo mundu jo ŵaajanjile ŵanyawo, “Mundu jwanamisye jula andanjile, ‘Njigale ugono wenu, njaule.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ŵanyawo ŵambusisye, “Ana ŵaani ansalile njigale ugono wenu njaule?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Nambo mundu juŵalamiswe jula nganammanyilila Che Yesu kuti ali ŵaani, pakuŵa pepala paliji ni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu ni Che Yesu ŵatyosile pepala.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Kanyuma Che Yesu ŵansimene mundu juŵannamisye jula pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni ŵansalile, “Mpilikane sambano nnamile, kasintenda sooni sambi, chinaiche kunsimana chindu chakusakala kupunda achichi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Mundu jula ŵajawile kukwasalila achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi kuti Che Yesu ni juŵalamisye. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Pakuŵa Che Yesu ŵatendekenye yeleyo pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila, Ŵayahudi ŵatandite kunchima. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Atati ŵangu akupanganya masengo moŵa gose ni uneji ngugapanganya iyoyo peyo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwa ligongo lyo, achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵapundile kusosasosa litala lyakwaulaga Che Yesu ngaŵa ligongo lyakutema malajisyo ga Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila pe, nambo pakuŵa alitesile kuti Akunnungu ali Atatigwe ni kulitenda chisau ni Akunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamusi wa Mwana jwa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngunsalila isyene, Mwana ngakukombola kupanganya chachilichose jikape. Mwana akukombola kupanganya achilape chakuchiwona alinkupanganya Atati. Pakuŵa achila chaakuchipanganya Atati Mwana nombejo akupanganya ilaila peila. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Atati akunnonyela Mwana ni kunlosya indu yose yakupanganya nsyene. Sooni chiŵalosye indu yekulungwa kupunda ayiyi, ni ŵanyamwe chinsimonje. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Mpela ila Atati iyakuti pakwasyusya ŵawile ni kwapa umi, iyoyo peyo ni Mwana akwapa umi aŵala ŵakwasaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Atati ngakunlamula mundu jwalijose, nambo ampele Mwanagwe ukombole wose wakwalamula ŵandu, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kuti ŵandu wose anchimbichisye Mwana mpela yakuti pakwachimbichisya Atati. Mundu jwalijose jwangakunchimbichisya Mwana ngakunchimbichisya Atati juŵantumile.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ngunsalila isyene, jwakulipikanila liloŵe lyangu ni kwakulupilila ŵandumile une ŵala, jwelejo akwete umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Nombejo ngaalamulikwa ng'oo, pakuŵa amasile kukopoka muchiwa ni kwinjila mu umi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ngunsalila isyene, chikaiche katema ni sambano kaiche chanti ŵandu ŵawile chalipilikane liloŵe lya Mwana jwa Akunnungu nombe ŵandu ŵachalipilikane wo chakole umi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Mpela ila Atati yatite kuŵa ndande ja umi, iyoyo peyo ampele Mwana kuŵa ndande ja umi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Sooni ampele Mwana ukombole wa kulamula ligongo jwelejo ali Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Nkachisimonga achichi pakuŵa chikaiche katema chati ŵandu wose ŵaali kumalembe chalipilikane liloŵe lyao, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nombe chasyuche, aŵala ŵaŵatendekenye yambone chasyuche ni kupata umi ni aŵala ŵaŵatendekenye yangalumbana chasyuche ni kulamulikwa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usyene nkati Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Uneji jikape ngangukombola kuchitendekanya chindu kwa ukombole wangu nansyene. Ngulamula mpela inguti pakupilikana kutyochela kwa Atati, ni kulamula kwangu kuli kwa usyene pakuŵa ngangupanganya ingusaka nansyene, nambo yambone paujo pao ŵandumile une ŵala.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Naliŵalangaga nansyene umboni wangu uli wa unami. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Nambo apali jwine jwakusala umboni pa une, noneji ngumanyilila kuti yose yakusala nkati uneji ili isyene. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ŵanyamwe mwalajisye ŵantenga ku che Yohana Ŵakubatisya, ni umboni wasasile nkati une uli usyene. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ngaŵa kuti uneji nguukulupilila umboni wa ŵandu, nambo ngusala yelei kuti ŵanyamwe nkulupuswe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Che Yohana ŵaliji mpela lumuli lulwakolelaga ni kulanguchisya, ni ŵanyamwe mwaliji chile kusengwa ni lilanguka lyakwe kwa katema pe. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Nambo uneji ngwete umboni kukwangu wauli wekulungwa kupunda u che Yohana. Pakuŵa masengo gingugapanganya gaambele Atati malichisye ni gagakulosya pangasisika kuti Atati ni ŵandumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Atati uŵandumile, iyoyo akusala umboni nkati une. Ŵanyamwe nganimme kulipilikana liloŵe lyao atamuno kukulola ku meeso kwao, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />ni liloŵe lyao ngalikutama nkati mwenu, pakuŵa nganimunkulupilila ajula juŵamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nkugasosasosa Malembelo ga Akunnungu nchiganisyaga kuti mu gelego chimpate umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Ni Malembelo ga Akunnungu go gakuŵalanga umboni nkati une! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ni ŵanyamwe ngankusaka kwika kukwangu kuti nkole umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ngangusosa kuchimbichikwa ni ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Nambo ngummanyilila ŵanyamwe kuti nganinkola unonyelo wa Akunnungu mmitima jenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Uneji iiche kwa ulamusi wa Atati ŵangu, ni ŵanyamwe nganimungulupilila. Aikaga mundu jwine kwa ulamusi wakwe nsyene, chimunkulupilile. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ana chinkombole chinauli kungulupilila iŵaga ŵanyamwe nkusaka kulapikwa kutyochela kwa achinjenu nambo nkukana kulapikwa kwakukutyochela kwa Akunnungu ŵaali jikape? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Nkaganisyaga kuti uneji chinambechetele kwa Atati. Che Musa junkunlolela ŵanyamwe ni juchambechetele kwa Atati. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Nkankulupilile che Musa nkaangulupilile ni une ŵakwe pakuŵa che Musa ŵalembile ngani syangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Nambo iŵaga ngankugakulupilila gaŵagalembile che Musa gala, sano chinkombole chinauli kugakulupilila ginguŵecheta?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuulisya mpingo wa ŵandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Payamasile yeleyo Che Yesu ŵajombweche litanda lya Galilaya pane likuŵilanjikwa litanda lya Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu wakuiye ligongo ŵandu wo ŵaiweni imanyisyo iŵapanganyisye kwa kwalamya ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Nipele Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵakwesile mwitumbi ni kutama. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Katema ka chindimba cha Pasaka ja Ŵayahudi kaŵandichile. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Che Yesu paŵalolesyelolesye ŵauweni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu uchaichililaga, nipele ŵausisye che Filipo, “Ana chitusume kwapi chakulya kuti twape ŵandu ŵa alye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ŵaŵechete yeleyo kuti ŵalinje che Filipo, pakuŵa asyene ŵaimanyi chichaapanganye.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Che Filipo ŵajanjile, “Ipande machila gaŵili ga madini ga feza ngaikukwana kusumila mikate kwa kila mundu!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵa Che Yesu jwakuŵilanjikwa che Andulea, mpwao che Simoni Petulo, ŵaasalile Che Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Kwana jwanchanda pelepa jwali ni ipande nsano ya mikate ja shayili ni somba siŵili. Nambo yakulya yi kanandi ngayajikutisya ŵandu ŵajinji ŵanti nyi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Mwasalile ŵandu atame paasi.” Pelepo paliji ni manyasi, nipele ŵandu wose ŵatemi paasi, winji wa achalume pe waliji mpela elufu tano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaijigele ipande ya mikate ila, ni ŵatogolele Akunnungu ni kwagaŵila ŵandu ŵaŵatemi paasi ŵala. Ŵatesile iyoyo peyo ni somba sila ni kila mundu ŵapatile mpela iŵatite pakusaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ŵandu wo paŵajikwite Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Nkumbikanye mbakatika yaisigele yo kuti inapotele.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nipele, ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵakumbikenye isigasi ya mikate nsano ja shayili iyasigesye ŵandu ŵaŵalile ŵala, ŵagumbesye itundu likumi ni iŵili. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ŵandu paŵachiweni chimanyisyo chiŵachipanganyisye Che Yesu cho, ŵatite, “Isyene ajuju ni jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu jwaŵechetekwe kuti chaiche pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Che Yesu ŵaimanyi kuti ŵandu ŵasachile kwakanganichisya aŵe mwenye jwao, ni ŵatyosile sooni jikape ni kwaula ku chitumbi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwenda pachanya meesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Pakwaswele ŵakulijiganya ŵa Che Yesu ŵatulwiche kwaula ku litanda. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa ŵatandite komboka kwaula ku Kapelenaumu. Chipi chajinjile ni Che Yesu ŵaliji akanaŵe kwaichilila. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Litanda lyatandite matumbela kwa ligongo lya chimbunga chekulungwa chichaliji chininkupuga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵajawile kwakutalichila uleu wa maili sitatu pane ncheche, ŵammweni Che Yesu alinkwenda pachanya meesi, ni kujiŵandichila ngalaŵa, ŵajogwepe nnope. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nkajogopa, ndili uneji!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵala kwakusangalala ŵammendile Che Yesu ajinjile mu ngalaŵa mula. Palapala ngalaŵa jaiche mungulugulu litanda kuŵajaulaga.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu akwasosasosa Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Malaŵi jakwe mpingo wa ŵandu uŵasigele peesi litanda ula ŵaimanyi kuti apala paliji ni ngalaŵa jimo pe. Che Yesu nganajinjila mu ngalaŵa pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao, nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵao wo ŵajawile achinsyene pe. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Syaiche ngalaŵa sine kutyochela ku Tibelia pepala mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu paŵalile mikate, Ambuje ali amasile kwatogolela Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Nipele, ŵandu wo paŵaimanyi kuti Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao nganapagwa pepala, ŵasikwesile ngalaŵa sila ni kwaula ku Kapelenaumu achinsosaga.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali chakulya cha umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ŵandu ŵala paŵasimene Che Yesu ali ajombweche ŵambusisye, “Ana, Jwakwiganya akuno nnyiche katema chi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Ngunsalila isyene, nkusosasosa une ngaŵa kwaligongo mwaiweni imanyisyo imbanganyisye, nambo kwaligongo mwalile mikate jila ni kwikuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kasinchenjeuchila chakulya chachikuwola, nambo nchenjeuchile chakulya chingachikuwola cha umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Mwana jwa Mundu champe chakulya chi pakuŵa Akunnungu Atati, alosisye kuti ansagwile ni kunkunda.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Nombewo ŵambusisye Che Yesu, “Tutende chichi kuti tukombole kugapanganya masengo gakugasakaga Akunnungu tugapanganye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Chelechi ni chakuchisaka Akunnungu nchipanganye, munkulupilile jwantumile jula.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Pelepo ŵaasalile, “Ana chintende chimanyisyo chi tulole kuti tunkulupilile mmwe? Chintende chichi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Achambuje ŵetu ŵalile chakulya chachikuŵilanjikwa mana mwipululu mula mpela igakuti pakusala Malembelo ga Akunnungu, ‘Ŵalisisye mikate jajityochele kwinani.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngunsalila isyene, che Musa nganampanga nkate kutyochela kwinani, nambo Atati ŵangu ni ŵampele ŵanyamwe nkate usyene kutyochela kwinani. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Pakuŵa nkate wakutupa Akunnungu uli ajula jwatulwiche kutyochela kwinani ni kwapa umi ŵandu ŵaali mchilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Nipele ŵaasalile, “Ambuje, ntupeje nkate wu kila lyuŵa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Uneji ndili nkate waukwikanawo umi. Jwakwika kukwangu ngasijinkola sala, jwakungulupilila une ngasijinkola njota ng'oo. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Nambo nansalile kuti namuno muuweni, nganimme kungulupilila. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wose ŵakuumba Atati chaiche kukwangu, noneji jwalijose jwakwika kukwangu ngasinankana ng'oo. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Nganinduluka kutyochela kwinani kwaligongo lya kuitendekanya ingusaka uneji, nambo ndulwiche kuti ndendekanye yakusaka ŵandumile une ŵala. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Yakusaka ŵandumile une ŵala ni ayiyi, ninanjase jwalijose juŵambele, nambo naasyusye pa lyuŵa lya mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Pakuŵa chakusaka Atati ŵangu ni achichi, jwalijose jwakunlola Mwana ni kunkulupilila akole umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi, ni uneji chinansyusye pa lyuŵa lya mbesi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵatandite kwasongonechela Che Yesu pakuŵa ŵatite, “Uneji ndili nkate wautulwiche kutyochela kwinani.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ni ŵatite, “Uli, ajuju ngaŵa Che Yesu mwana ju che Yusufu jula? Atatigwe ni achikulugwe twamanyi! Ana akukombola chinauli kuti atulwiche kutyochela kwinani?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nneche kusongonechelana jwine ni jwine. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Ngapagwa mundu juchakombole kwika kukwangu pangali Atati juŵandumile une jo kwautila kukwangu, ni une chinansyusye mundu jo pa lyuŵa lyambesi. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ŵalembile kuti, ‘Ŵandu wose chajiganyikwe ni Akunnungu.’ Mundu jwalijose jwakumpilikana Atati ni kulijiganya kutyochela kwa ŵelewo, chaiche kukwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ngapagwa mundu jwambweni Atati, ikaŵe ajula pe jwatyosile kwa Akunnungu, jwelejo ni juŵambweni Atati. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ngunsalila isyene, jwakukulupilila akwete umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Uneji ndili nkate waukwikanawo umi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Achambuje ŵenu ŵalile mana mwipululu mula, nambo ŵawile. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Nambo weleu ni nkate waukutuluka kutyochela kwinani kuti jwalijose jwakulya anajasiche. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Uneji ndili nkate waukwikanawo umi wautulwiche kutyochela kwinani. Mundu jwalijose alyaga nkate wo chalame moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Ni nkate uchinaape wo uli chiilu changu chinguchityosya kuti ŵandu wose ŵapachilambo akole umi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵatandite kwangangana achinsyene pe, “Ana aju akukombola chinauli kutupa uwe chiilu chakwe kuti tulye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngunsalila isyene, iŵaga ngankulya chiilu cha Mwana jwa Mundu ni kung'wa miasi jakwe, ngankola umi nkati mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mundu jwalijose jwakulya chiilu changu ni kungwa miasi jangu akwete umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi, ni uneji chinansyusye pa lyuŵa lyambesi. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Pakuŵa chiilu changu chili chakulya chisyenesyene, ni miasi jangu jili chakung'wa chisyenesyene. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mundu jwalijose jwakulya chiilu changu ni kung'wa miasi jangu, jwelejo akutama nkati mwangu ni uneji ngutama mwa jwelejo. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Mpela ila Atati ŵaali ŵajumi iŵandumile, ni kwa ligongo lya Atati ndili ŵajumi, kwayele jwakundya une chaŵe ŵajumi kwa ligongo lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Nipele, weleu uli nkate wautulwiche kutyochela kwinani, ngaŵa mpela mana jiŵalile achambuje ŵenu ni kuwa. Nambo juchalye nkate wu chakole umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Che Yesu ŵaŵechete yeleyo paŵaliji nkwiganya mu nyuumba ja kusimanilana Ŵayahudi ku Kapelenaumu kula.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maloŵe gagakwikanawo umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajinji paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵatite, “Aga majiganyo ga gali gakulimba! Ana nduni juchakombole kugakunda?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Che Yesu ŵaimanyi pangasalilwa ni mundu kuti ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaliji nkusongoneka yankati yeleyo, ni ŵausisye, “Ana majiganyo ga gakuntesya nneche kungulupilila? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Nambi chiiŵe uli pachimummone Mwana jwa Mundu alinkujigalikwa kwaula kwinani kuŵaliji kundanda? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ni jwakwichisya umi, machili ga mundu gangali chindu. Maloŵe ginansalile gali Mbumu nombe gali umi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Natamuno yeleyo apali ŵane mwa ŵanyamwe ŵangakukulupilila.” Che Yesu ŵaŵechete yeleyo pakuŵa ŵaimanyi chitandile kundanda kuti ŵaani ŵangakulupilila ni nduni juchangalauche. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaŵechete sooni, “Kwa ligongo lyo nansalile kuti ngapagwa juchakombole kwika kukwangu mpaka akamuchikwe ni Atati ŵangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kutyochela lyuŵa lyo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajinji ŵalesile kulongana nawo kwaligongo lya maloŵe gala ni ŵaujile panyuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵala, “Ana, ni ŵanyamwe nombe nkusaka kwaula?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Che Simoni Petulo ŵajanjile, “Ambuje, tutujaule kwa acheni? Mmwejo nkwete maloŵe gagakwikanawo umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Uweji tukukulupilila ni sooni tukwimanyilila kuti mmwejo ndi Jwanswela kutyochela kwa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Uli, nganinansagula ŵanyamwe likumi ni ŵaŵili? Nambo jumo jwenu ali Shetani.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaliji nkwagamba che Yuda mwana ju che Simoni Isikaliote, pakuŵa jwelejo ni juchangalauche namuno ali jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵala.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni achapwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Payamasile yeleyo, Che Yesu ŵaliji nkwendajenda ku Galilaya ko. Nganasaka kwendajenda ku Yudea ligongo achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵasachile kwaulaga. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Chindimba cha Ŵayahudi cha masakasa chaŵandichile. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Nipele achapwakwe Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ntyoche pelepa njaule ku Yudea kuti ŵakunkuya mmwe nombewo aiwone yakusimonjeka inkwipanganya. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ngapagwa mundu jwakupanganya chindu kwakulisisa iŵaga akusaka kumanyika ni ŵandu. Pakuŵa nkupanganya yelei, nlilosye mwasyene kwa ŵandu ŵa pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Namose achapwakwe nganiŵakulupilila. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Katema kambone kukwangu kakanaŵe kwika, kukwenu ŵanyamwe katema kakalikose kali kambone. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ŵandu ŵa pachilambo ngakombola kunchima ŵanyamwe, nambo uneji akunjima pakuŵa naasalile kuti yakuitendekanya yo ili yangalumbana. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ŵanyamwe njaule kuchindimba cho. Uneji ngunyaula kuchindimba cho pakuŵa katema kambone kukwangu kakanaŵe kwika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ŵaŵechete yeleyo ni kusigala pa Galilaya palapala.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu kuchindimba cha masakasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Achapwakwe paŵamasile kwaula kuchindimba cha masakasa, Che Yesu nombe ŵajawile, nambo nganajaula kwakulilosya, ŵajawile kwakulisisa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Kuchindimba cho achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵaliji nkwasosasosa Che Yesu, ni ŵausyene, “Ana ali kwapi ŵelewo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mpingo wa ŵandu waliji nkusongona jwine ni jwine yankati Che Yesu. Ŵandu ŵane ŵatite, “Ali mundu jwambone.” Ni ŵane ŵatite, “Ngaŵa! Akwalambusya ŵandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Atamuno yeleyo ngapagwa mundu jwalijose jwalinjile kuŵecheta ngani syakwe pelanga kwa ligongo lya kwajogopa achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Chindimba cho pichaŵandichile kumala, Che Yesu ŵajawile pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni kutanda kwiganya. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Nipele achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵasimosile ni kuti, “Ana mundu ju agapatile kwapi majiganyo ga, nombejo nganajaule kukulijiganya?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Majiganyo gungwiganya nganigaŵa gangu, nambo gakutyochela kwa ŵelewo ŵandumile une. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mundu asakaga kupanganya yakusaka Akunnungu, chaimanyilile kuti majiganyo gungwiganya gatyosile kwa Akunnungu pane nguŵecheta kwa ukombole wangu nansyene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Jwelejo jwakuŵecheta ngani syakwe nsyene akusosasosa ukulu wakwe nsyene, nambo jwakusosasosa ukulu wa jwannajisye jula, jwelejo ali jwausyene ni mwa jwelejo ngapagwa unami. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ana che Musa nganampanga malajisyo? Atamuno yeleyo, ngapagwa jwalijose mwa ŵanyamwe jwakugatendekanya gagalembekwe mmalajisyo go. Ana ligongo chi nkusaka kumulaga?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Papopo mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu wajanjile, “Ana mmwe nkwete masoka! Nduni jwakusaka kummulaga mmwe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Mbanganyisye chakusimonjeka chimo ni ŵanyamwe nkuchisimonga. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Che Musa ŵampele chisyoŵelo cha kwaumbasya achiŵana ŵenu. Nambo chisyoŵelo cho nganichityochela ku che Musa nambo chatyochele kwa achambuje ŵenu. Sambano ŵanyamwe nkummumbasya mwanache pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Iŵaga mundu akuumbala pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila kuti ganatemeche malajisyo, sambano kwa chichi nkuundumbilila une ligongo nannamisye mundu pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Kasinlamula kwa meeso pe, nambo nlamule kwa goloka.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola jwatumikwe ni Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵa ku Yelusalemu ŵatandite kuliusya, “Ana mundu ju ngaŵa ajula jwakusosekwa ni ilongola kuti ammulaje? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nnole, sambano akuŵecheta pelanga, nombe ngapagwa mundu jwakuntanjila chachilichose. Uli, ilongola akwimanyilila kuti aju ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Pachaiche Kilisito ngapagwa mundu juchakumanye kwakopochele, nambo uweji tukumanyi kwakopochele mundu ju!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Nipele Che Yesu paŵaliji nkwiganya pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Ana ŵanyamwe nkuumanyilila une ni sooni nkumanyi kungopochele? Une nguniika kwa ulamusi wangu nansyene, nambo ŵandumile une wo ali ŵausyenesyene, ni ŵanyamwe ngunkwamanyilila, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />uneji ngwamanyilila pakuŵa ngopochele kwa ŵelewo, nombewo ni ŵandumile une.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Nipele ŵandu ŵasachile kwakamula, nambo nganapagwa mundu jwalijose jwalinjile kunkwaya, ligongo katema kakwe kaliji kakanaŵe kwika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Mumpingo wa ŵandu mula, ŵandu ŵajinji ŵakulupilile ni kuti, “Ana aikaga Kilisito Jwakuwombola chapanganye imanyisyo yekulungwa kupunda ayiyi yakuitendekanya aŵa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakulindilila akutumikwa kukwakamula Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo ŵapilikene ŵandu achisongonaga jwine ni jwine yankati Che Yesu. Nipele achakulu ŵambopesi pamo ni Mafalisayo ŵatumile ŵakulindilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu akaakamule Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Chindame ni ŵanyamwe kwa katema kakajipi, nipele chinyaule kwa ŵandumile ŵala. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Chimuusose nambo ngamuuwona, pakuŵa pepala pachime ŵanyamwe ngankombolanga kwika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵausyanaga achinsyene pe, “Ana mundu ju chajaule kwapi kwakuti ngatukombola kwawona? Ana chajaule kwa Ŵayahudi ŵapwilingene ni kutama mu misi ja Ŵagiliki ni kwajiganya Ŵagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ana malumbo gakwe chichi pakuti, ‘Chimuusose nambo ngamuuwona, ni pepala pachime ŵanyamwe ngankombola kwika?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulo syasikuilima meesi gagakwikanawo umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Lyuŵa lya mbesi lya chindimba cho lyaliji lyuŵa lyekulungwa. Che Yesu ŵajimi ni kuŵecheta kwa liloŵe lyakunyanyisya, “Mundu jwalijose jwakwete njota aiche kung'wa kukwangu. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Mpela Malembelo ga Akunnungu yagakuti pakusala, ‘Jwakungulupilila uneji, sulo sya meesi gagakwikanawo umi chigajilime kutyochela nkati mwao!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ŵaŵechete yeleyo nkati Mbumu jwa Akunnungu juchapochelwe ni aŵala ŵakwakulupilila Che Yesu. Mpaka katema ko ŵandu ŵaliji nganampochele Mbumu jwa Akunnungu pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵaliji akanaŵe kunkusya Che Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulekangana kwa ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ŵandu ŵane mu mpingo ula ŵapilikene maloŵe go, ni ŵatite, “Isyene mundu ju ali jwakulondola jula!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵatite, “Aju ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola!” Nambo ŵandu ŵane ŵaliji nkuliusya, “Ana ikukomboleka Kilisito akopochele ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ana Malembelo ga Akunnungu ngagakuti, ‘Kilisito Jwakuwombola chakopochele mu lukosyo lwa mwenye che Daudi, ni chapagwe ku Beselehemu, musi uŵatemi mwenye che Daudi?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵa mumpingo ŵalekangene kwa ligongo lya Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵasachile kwakamula nambo ngapagwa mundu jwalijose juŵankwaiye.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi akukananga kwakulupilila Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Nipele ŵakulindilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu paŵausile, achakulu ŵambopesi ni Mafalisayo, ŵausisye, “Kwachichi nganimwaichisya Che Yesu?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Ŵakulindilila ŵala ŵajanjile, “Nganapagwe mundu jwalijose jwakombwele kuŵecheta mpela mundu ju!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Nipele Mafalisayo ŵausisye, “Ana annambwisye ni ŵanyamwe ŵakwe? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ana mpatile kumbona jumo jwa ilongola, pane jumo jwa Mafalisayo jwankulupilile jwelejo? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ngwamba, nambo ŵandu ŵa ngakugamanyilila malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa, kwayele Akunnungu ŵalwesisye!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Jumo jwao ŵaliji che Nikodemu jumo jwa Mafalisayo juŵajaulile Che Yesu kundanda, ŵaasalile achinjakwe, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Malajisyo getu gakusala kuti, ngatukukombola kunlamula mundu jwalijose pangampilikanila kaje ni kwimanyilila chichi chakupanganya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ni ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Ni ŵanyamwe ŵakwe ntyochele ku Galilaya? Nsosesose Mmalembelo Gamaswela nomwe chinnole kuti ku Galilaya ngaakopochela jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Nipele kila mundu ŵausile kumangwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Jwankongwe juŵakamwilwe ku chikululu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Pakumala yeleyo Che Yesu ŵajawile ku chikwesya cha Miseituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Malaŵi jakwe kundaŵi pe, Che Yesu ŵajawile sooni pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. Ŵandu wose ŵansyungwile, nombewo ŵatemi ni kutanda kwajiganya. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Nipele Ŵakwiganya malajisyo pamo ni Mafalisayo ŵannyichenawo jwankongwe juŵakamwilwe ali nkutenda chikululu. Ŵanjimiche jwankongwe jo paujo pa ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Nipele ŵambusisye Che Yesu, “Jwakwiganya, jwankongwe ju akamwilwe ali nkutenda chikululu. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mmalajisyo getu che Musa ŵatulajisye yele, jwankongwe mpela aju aulajikwe kwa kuputikwa ni maganga. Nambi mmwejo nkuti uli?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ŵatite yeleyo kuti ŵalinje Che Yesu akole chakumbechetela. Nambo Che Yesu ŵakoteme ni kulemba paasi ni chala chakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Paŵapundile kumbusya, Che Yesu ŵajinamukwiche ni kwasalila, “Naga kwana mundu jwalijose mwa ŵanyamwe jwanganakola sambi aŵe jwaandanda kumponya liganga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Nipele ŵakoteme sooni ni kulemba paasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵatandite kutyoka jumo jumo achilongolelaga achachekulu. Che Yesu ŵasigele jikape ni jwankongwe jula ali ajimi palapala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ni Che Yesu paŵajinamukwiche ŵambusisye jwankongwe jula, “Amao, ŵandu ŵala alinji kwapi? Uli, ngapagwa jwanlamwile mmwejo?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Jwankongwe jula ŵajanjile, “Ambuje, ngapagwa namose jumo jwanamwile!” Nombe Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Uneji nombe ngangunlamula. Njaule, nambo kutandila sambano nkatenda sambi sooni.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali lilanguka lya chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Che Yesu ŵakungulwiche sooni ni ŵandu achitiji, “Uneji ndili lilanguka lya pachilambo pano. Mundu jwalijose jwakunguya uneji ngajenda mu chipi ng'o, nambo chakole ni lilanguka lya umi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Nipele Mafalisayo ŵansalile, “Nkusala umboni wenu mwasyene, sambano umboni wenu uli wa unami.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Atamuno nasalaga umboni wangu nansyene, umboni wangu uli usyene ligongo uneji nakumanyi kungopochele ni kungwaula. Nambo mwanya ngankukumanyilila kungopochele ni kungwaula. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ŵanyamwe nkulamula kwa ng'anisyo sya chiundu nambo uneji ngangunlamula mundu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Naatamuno nalamulaga, ulamusi wangu uli usyene ligongo uneji ngangupanganya masengo jika, Atati ŵandumile une wo ali pamo ni une. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ilembekwe mmalajisyo genu, umboni wa ŵandu ŵaŵili uli wa usyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Uneji ngusala umboni wangu nansyene, ni Atati ŵandumile nombe akusala umboni wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Pelepo ŵambusisye, “Ana Atati ŵenu ali kwapi?” Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ŵanyamwe ngankuumanyilila uneji atamuno ngankummanyilila Atati ŵangu. Nkaamanyilile uneji nkaamanyilile Atati ŵangu nombe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Che Yesu ŵaŵechete maloŵe go mu chuumba cha mbiko, paŵaliji nkwiganya pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. Ni nganapagwa mundu juŵankamwile pakuŵa katema kakwe kaliji kakanaŵe kwika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kungwaula ŵanyamwe ngankombolanga kwika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile sooni, “Uneji ngwaula ni ŵanyamwe chimuusose, nambo chimmwe mu sambi syenu. Kungwaula uneji, ŵanyamwe ngankombola kwika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Nipele, achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵatite, “Ana chaliulaje? Ana kwa ligongo chi akuti, ‘Kungwaula ŵanyamwe ngankombola kwika?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe nkopochele papapa pachilambo cha paasi, nambo uneji ngopochele kwinani. Ŵanyamwe nlinji ŵa pachilambo pano, nambo uneji nguniŵa jwa pachilambo pano. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Kwaligongo lyo nansalile kuti chimmwe mu sambi syenu. Pakuŵa ngankukulupilila kuti, ‘Uneji ndili jwelejo’ chimmwe mu sambi syenu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nombe ŵanyawo ŵambusisye, “Ana mmwejo ni ŵaani?” Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Uneji ndili jwelejo, mpela inansalile chitandile kundanda! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ngwete yejinji yakuŵecheta ni kulamula nkati ŵanyamwe. Nambo ŵandumile une ali ŵausyene, none ngwasalila ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo yeila pe imbilikene kutyochela kwa ŵelewo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ŵanyawo nganaimanyilila kuti Che Yesu ŵaŵechetaga nawo yankati ngani sya Akunnungu, Atati ŵao. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Pachimunnyakule Mwana jwa Mundu, pelepo ni pachimmanyilile kuti, ‘Uneji ndili jwelejo,’ ni chimmanyilile kuti ngangupanganya chachili chose nansyene, nambo nguŵecheta yeila pe inyiganyikwe ni Atati. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ŵandumile ŵala ali pamo ni uneji, nganaaneka jika, pakuŵa moŵa gose nguitendekanya aila yaikwanonyela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaŵampilikanile Che Yesu achiŵechetaga maloŵe ga ŵankulupilile.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usyenesyene chiuntende ŵalecheleswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile Ŵayahudi ŵaŵakulupilile ŵala kuti, “Mwaikamulichisyaga inanjigenye, chimme ŵakulijiganya ŵangu ŵa usyenesyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Chimuumanyilile usyene, ni usyene wo chiuntende ŵalecheleswe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nombe ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Tuli uŵelesi u che Iblahimu ni nganituŵa achikapolo ŵa mundu jwalijose. Ana malumbo gakwe chichi pankuti, ‘Chinchilecheleswa?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Ngunsalila isyene, mundu jwalijose jwakutendekanya sambi ali kapolo jwa sambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Kapolo ngakutama pamusi moŵa gose, nambo mwanache akutama pamusi moŵa gose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Nipele Mwana annechelesyaga ŵanyamwe nombe chimbe ŵalecheleswe kusyenesyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Naimanyi kuti ŵanyamwe nlinji uŵelesi u che Iblahimu. Nambo nkusaka kumulaga ligongo nkugakana majiganyo gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Uneji nguŵecheta aila pe yanosisye Atati ŵangu, nambo ŵanyamwe nkupanganya aila yansalile atati ŵenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Uweji Atati ŵetu ali che Iblahimu!” Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe nkaŵe ŵanache ŵa che Iblahimu nkaitendekenye aila iŵaitendekenye che Iblahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Uneji nansalile usyene unaupilikene kutyochela kwa Akunnungu, atamuno yeleyo ŵanyamwe nkusaka kumulaga. Che Iblahimu nganapanganya yeleyo! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ŵanyamwe nkutendekanya ilaila yaitesile atati ŵenu.” Ŵanyawo ŵansalile, “Uweji nganitupagwe kwa chikululu! Tukwete atati ŵamope, ŵelewo ali Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ikaŵe Akunnungu ali Atati ŵenu, nkaanonyele uneji pakuŵa uneji natyosile kwa Akunnungu ni sambano ndili papapa pepa. Nguniika kwa malamulo gangu nansyene nambo kwa malamulo ga ŵandumile une wo. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ana kwachichi ngankugapilikanichisya ginguŵecheta ga? Ligongo ngankusaka kugapilikana maloŵe gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Ŵanyamwe atati ŵenu Jwakulinga ni ŵanyamwe nkusaka kutendekanya yaikwanonyelesya atati ŵenu. Chitandile kundanda jwelejo ŵaliji jwakuulaga, ni nganawai kwima ku upande wa usyene, mwa jwelejo nganiupagwa usyene. Paakuŵecheta ya unami, akuŵecheta yatite kusyoŵelela, pakuŵa jwelejo ali jwa unami ni atati jwa unami wose. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Pakuŵa uneji ngunsalila usyene, ŵanyamwe ngankungulupilila. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Mwa ŵanyamwe nduni juchakombole kuŵalanga umboni kuti uneji ngwete sambi? Ana iŵaga nguŵecheta usyene, kwachichi ngankungulupilila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu akugapilikana maloŵe gakuŵecheta Akunnungu, ŵanyamwe ngankupilikana pakuŵa ŵanyamwe nganimma ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ŵapali akanaŵe kupagwa che Iblahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ŵayahudi ŵanjanjile Che Yesu, “Ana nganitusala uchenene kuti mmwejo ndi Msamalia ni sooni nkwete lisoka?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Uneji nganingola lisoka. Uneji ngwachimbichisya Atati ŵangu, nambo ŵanyamwe ngankunjimbichisya une. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Uneji ngangulisosela ukulu wangu nansyene. Apali jumo jwakuusosela ukulu wo, nombejo ali jwakulamula. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ngunsalila isyene, mundu jwalijose jwakugakamulichisya majiganyo gangu ngaawa nambo chatame moŵa gose pangali mbesi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ŵayahudi ŵansalile Che Yesu, “Sambano twimanyi uchenene kuti mmwejo nkwete lisoka! Che Iblahimu ŵawile, ni ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ŵawile iyoyo peyo, nomwe nkuti, ‘Mundu jwalijose agakamulichisyaga majiganyo gangu ngaawa!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ana mmwejo nkulitenda ŵakulungwa kwapunda atati ŵetu che Iblahimu juŵawile jula? Natamuno ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ŵawile nombewo. Sambano mmwejo nkulitenda ŵaani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nalikusyaga une nansyene, ukulu wangu ngaŵa chindu. Atati ŵangu ŵankwaŵilanga Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵelewo ni ŵakungusya une. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ŵanyamwe ngannaŵe kwamanyilila, nambo uneji naamanyi. Nombe nasalaga kuti ngangwamanyilila, chime jwaunami mpela ŵanyamwe. Uneji ngwamanyilila ni ngulikamulichisya liloŵe lyao. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Atati ŵenu che Iblahimu ŵasangalele aliwone lyuŵa lya kwika kwangu, nombewo ŵaliweni ni ŵasengwile.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵaasalile, “Mmwejo nkuti uli kuti mwaweni che Iblahimu nomwe nganinnyiche yaka makumi nsano?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngunsalila isyene, akanaŵe kupagwa che Iblahimu uneji napali.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Pelepo ŵalokwete maganga achisakaga kwaponya, nambo Che Yesu ŵaalesile ni kutyoka pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunlamya mundu jwapagwile ali ngakulola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Che Yesu paŵapitaga, ŵambweni mundu jwangalola chitandile kupagwa kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵausisye, “Jwakwiganya, Ana ŵaani ŵatesile sambi mpaka mundu ju apagwe ali ngakulola, mundu ju pane achaŵelesi ŵakwe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ngaŵa mundu ju atamuno achaŵelesi ŵakwe ŵaŵatesile sambi, nambo apagwile jwangalola kuti machili ga Akunnungu gawoneche gachipanganyaga masengo mu utame wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tukusachilwa kupanganya masengo ga ŵandumile une ŵala muusi uli chiŵela. Pakuŵa chilo chikwika ni ngapagwa mundu jwakukombola kupanganya masengo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ndili chiŵela mchilambo, uneji ndili lulanga lwa ŵandu ŵa pachilambo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo, ŵasunile mata paasi ŵagumbile litaka ni mata ni kumpakasya pa meeso jwangalola jula. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Nipele ŵansalile jwangalola jula, “Njaule nkasukusule mu litanda lya Siloamu.” Siloamu malumbo gakwe “Ŵaŵalajiswe.” Pelepo jwangalola jo ŵajawile ni kusukusula, nipele ŵausile kumusi ali nkulola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Nipele, ŵapachiŵandi ŵakwe ni aŵala ŵaŵambweni ali nkuŵendaŵenda kundanda ŵaliusisye, “Ana ajuju nganaŵa ajula mundu juŵaŵendaŵendaga?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵatite, “Ni jwelejo.” Nambo ŵane ŵatite, “Ajuju nganaŵa jwelejo agambile kulandana.” Nambo nsyene ŵatite, “Uneji ndili jujojo junaŵendaŵendaga!” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Nipele ŵambusisye, “Sambano iŵele uli nkulola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Mundu jwakuŵilanjikwa Che Yesu jula ŵagumbile litaka, ŵambakesye pa meeso ni kuusalila, ‘Njaule nkasukusule mu litanda lya Siloamu.’ Pelepo uneji najawile ni panasukusulaga natandite kulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Ni ŵambusisye, “Ana mundu jo alikwapi?” Nombejo ŵaajanjile, “Kwaalini!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo akummuchilichisya jwangalola yatite pakulama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Nipele ŵandu ŵanjawisye ajula juŵaliji ngakulola kundanda kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Lyuŵa lyo Che Yesu paŵagumbile litaka ni kumbugula meeso jwangalola jula lyaliji Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Nipele Mafalisayo ŵambusisye ajula mundu juŵaliji ngakulola kundanda, “Ana nkombwele chinauli kulola?” Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Ŵambakesye litaka pa meeso, none nasukuswile ni sambano ngulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo ŵane ŵatite, “Mundu jwatesile yeleyi nganatyochela kwa Akunnungu pakuŵa ngakugakamula malajisyo ga Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila.” Nambo ŵandu ŵane ŵatite, “Ana mundu jwali ni sambi chakombole kutendekanya imanyisyo mpela ayiyi?” Nipele, kwaliji ni utinda mwa ŵandu wo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Nipele Mafalisayo ŵambusisye sooni juŵaliji ngakulola jula, “Nkuti ambugwile meeso genu, sambano mmwejo nkuŵecheta ichichi nkati mundu jo?” Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Mundu jo ali jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi nganajitichisya kuti mundu jo ŵaliji ngakulola chitandilile kundanda ni sambano akulola, mpaka paŵaaŵilasile achaŵelesi ŵakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Ŵausisye, “Ana aju ngati ni mwanagwenu junkuti ŵapagwile ngakulola? Ana sambano akombwele chinauli kulola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Achaŵelesi ŵakwe ŵajanjile, “Tukwimanyilila kuti ajuju ni mwanagwetu ni tukwimanyilila kuti ŵapagwile jwangalola. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Nambo akombwele chinauli kulola ngatukumanyilila, ni jwantesile akombole kulola nombejo ngatukwamanyilila. Mumbusye nsyene, jwelejo ali jwankule, chaliŵalanje.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Achaŵelesi ŵakwe ŵaŵechete yeleyo ligongo ŵaajogwepe achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi, pakuŵa ŵelewo ŵalangene chile kuti, mundu jwalijose ajitichisyaga kuti Che Yesu ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola chaŵinjikwe mu nyuumba ja kupopelela. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Lyelelyo ni ligongo achaŵelesi ŵakwe ŵatite, “Jwelejo ali jwankule, mumbusye nsyene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Nipele ŵambilasile kaaŵili juŵapagwile ali ngakulola jula ni kunsalila, “Nnumbile kwa Akunnungu iŵaga nkusala isyene! Uweji tukwimanyilila kuti mundu jwannamisye mmwe ali jwa sambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Iŵaga mundu ju ali jwa sambi pane nganakola sambi une ngangwimanyilila. Nambo une nguchimanyilila chindu chimo, kuti naliji jwangalola ni sambano ngulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Nipele Ŵambusisye sooni, “Ana antesile chichi? Ana agaugwile chinauli meeso genu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Mundu jo ŵajanjile, “Nansalile sampano, ni ŵanyamwe nganinsaka kupilikanichisya, kwachichi nkusaka kupilikanila sooni ngani ji? Uli, nombe ŵanyamwe nkusaka kuŵa ŵakulijiganya ŵakwe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Nambo ŵanyawo ŵantukene achitiji, “Mmwe ndi jwakulijiganya jwa mundu jo, nambo uweji tuli ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Uweji tuimanyi kuti Akunnungu ŵaŵechete ni che Musa, nambo mundu ju ngatukukumanyilila kwakopochele!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Nombejo ŵaajanjile, “Ŵanyamwe nkuusimosya! Ŵanyamwe ngankukumanyilila kwakopochele mundu ju, nambo agaugwile meeso gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tukumanyilila kuti Akunnungu ngakwapilikanila ŵandu ŵaali ni sambi, nambo Akunnungu akumpilikanila mundu jwakunchimbichisya ni kupanganya yakusaka. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Chitandile gumbikwa chilambo ngapagwa mundu jwapilikene kuti mundu agaugwile meeso ga mundu jwapagwilwe ali ngakulola. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Iŵaga mundu ju nganatyochela kwa Akunnungu, ngaakakombole kupanganya chachili chose!” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Mmwejo mwapagwilwe ni kukula mu sambi ana nomwe nkusaka kutujiganya uweji?” Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵambinjile mundu jo mu nyuumba ja kupopelela.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ungalola wa mu ntima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Che Yesu ŵapilikene kuti mundu juŵannamisye jula aŵinjikwe pa Nyuumba ja Kupopelela. Nipele paŵansimene ŵambusisye, “Ana mmwejo nkunkulupilila Mwana jwa Mundu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Mundu jo ŵajanjile, “Ambuje, ana ŵelewo ali ŵaani, musalile kuti nakulupilile.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Sambano mummweni, nombe ni jwelejo jwakukunguluka nomwe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Nipele mundu jo ŵatite, “Ambuje, ngukulupilila!” Ni ŵatindiŵele ni kwakotamila.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Che Yesu ŵatite, “Uneji nyiche pachilambo pano kukwasapulanya ŵandu, kuti ŵangalola akombole kulola, ni ŵakulola aŵeje ŵangalola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo ŵane ŵaŵaliji pamo ni Che Yesu ŵagapilikene maloŵe go, ni ŵambusisye, “Uli, nowe ŵakwe tuli ŵangalola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nkaliji ŵangalola, ngankaŵe ni sambi, nambo sambano ŵanyamwe nkulitenda, ‘Uweji tukulola,’ yelei ikulosya kuti nli mu sambi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali jwakuchinga jwambone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngunsalila isyene, mundu jwalijose jwakwinjila mu lichinga lya ngondolo pangajinjilila pa nnango, nambo akwinjilila kwine, jwelejo ali jwawiyi ni jwakusumula. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Nambo jwakwinjilila pa nnango, jwelejo ali jwakuchinga ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Jwakulindilila akumbugulila nnango mundu jo, ni ngondolo sikupilikana liloŵe lya jwakuchinga, nombejo akusiŵilanga ngondolo syakwe jwalijose kwa liina lyakwe ni kusikoposya paasa. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Amalaga kusikoposya paasa akusilongolela, nombe ngondolo syo sikunkuya, pakuŵa sikulimanyilila liloŵe lyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ngondolo syo ngasikombola kunkuya jwannendo, nambo sisimmutuche pakuŵa ngasikumanyilila liloŵe lyakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile chitagu cho, nambo ŵandu wo nganaimanyilila chasachile kwasalila. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaŵechete sooni, “Ngunsalila isyene, uneji ndili nnango wa kwinjilila ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Ŵane wose ŵaŵanongolele kwika ŵaliji ŵawiyi ni ŵakusumula, nombe ngondolo syo nganisyapilikanila. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Uneji ndili nnango, mundu jwalijose jwakwinjila mu lichinga kwa kwinjilila kukwangu chakulupuswe, chajinjile ni kukopoka, ni kupata yakulya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Jwawiyi akwika achisakaga kwiŵa ni kuulaga ni kujonanga. Uneji iiche kuti akole umi wa usyene, wangaukupungula.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Uneji ndili jwakuchinga jwambone. Jwakuchinga jwambone akuutyosya umi wakwe kwa ligongo lya ngondolo syakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Jwamasengo jwanganaŵa jwakuchinga, namose nganaŵa nsyene ngondolo. Pakugawona masogo gali nkwika, akusileka ngondolo ni kuutuka. Nipele masogo gakusikamula ni kusipwilinganya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Mundu jo akuutuka pakuŵa ali mundu jwamasengo jwa malipilo ni ngondolo ngaŵa chindu kukwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Uneji ndili jwakuchinga jwambone. Ngusimanyilila ngondolo syangu ni ngondolo syangu sikuumanyilila une, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />mpela ila Atati yakuti pakuumanyilila, ni uneji inguti pakwamanyilila Atati. Uneji nguutyosya umi wangu kwa ligongo lya ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Sooni ngwete ngondolo sine syangaŵa sya lichinga li. Nombesyo ngusachilwa kusiichisya, nombesyo sisipilikane liloŵe lyangu ni chikuŵe mpingo umo ni jwakuchinga jumo.”<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Atati akuunonyela une ligongo nguutyosya umi wangu kuti mbochele sooni. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Ngapagwa mundu jwakuusumula umi wangu, uneji nguutyosya nansyene. Ngwete ukombole wa kuutyosya ni ukombole wa kuutola. Yelei ni yatite pakulajisya Atati ŵangu mbanganye.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kwa ligongo lya maloŵe ga Che Yesu, Ŵayahudi ŵatindene sooni. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Ŵajinji mwa ŵelewo ŵatite, “Akwete lisoka, ni sooni jwampugwe! Kwachichi nkumpilikanila?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵatite, “Mundu jwakamwilwe ni lisoka ngakukombola kuŵecheta yelei. Ana lisoka likukombola kugaugula meeso ga ŵandu ŵangalola?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵayahudi akwakana Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ku Yelusalemu ko kwaliji ni chindimba chakukumbuchila kujiŵika pajika Nyuumba kwa ligongo lya Ambuje. Ni katema ko kaliji katema ka mbepo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Nombe Che Yesu ŵaliji nkwendajenda pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu pansana pa mwenye Che Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵaasyungwile, ni ŵambusisye, “Ana chintuleche tuli nkuganisya mpaka chakachi? Iŵaga mmwe ndi Kilisito Jwakuwombola, ntusalile uchenene.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nansalile, nambo nganimungulupilila. Masengo gingugapanganya kwa ulamusi wa Atati ŵangu gakulosya kuti une ndili jwelejo. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Nambo ŵanyamwe ngankukulupilila pakuŵa ŵanyamwe nganimma ngondolo syangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ngondolo syangu sikupilikana liloŵe lyangu. Uneji ngusimanyilila, nombesyo sikuunguya. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Uneji ngusipa umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi, nombesyo ngasiwa ng'o. Ngapagwa mundu jwalijose juchakombole kuumbokonya. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Atati ŵangu juŵambele ngondolo syo ali jwankulu kupunda wose, nombe ngapagwa mundu jwalijose juchakombole kusipokonya mmakono mwa Atati ŵangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Uneji ni Atati ŵangu tuli ŵamo.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵalokwete sooni maganga kuti ŵaulaje Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nannosisye masengo gambone gamajinji gaŵambele Atati ŵangu kuti nagapanganye. Ana masengo chi gambone mwa gelego gankusaka kumulajila?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ŵayahudi ŵajanjile, “Ngatukumponya maganga kwa ligongo lya masengo gambone, nambo kwa ligongo lya kwatukana Akunnungu! Pakuŵa mmwejo ndi mundu pe, nambo nkulitenda Akunnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ilembekwe Mmalajisyo genu kuti, Akunnungu ŵatite, ‘Ŵanyamwe ndi achiminungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Akunnungu ŵaaŵilasile achiminungu aŵala wose ŵaŵasalilwe liloŵe lyao, ni uweji tuimanyi kuti Malembelo ga Akunnungu gakuŵecheta usyene moŵa gose. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Sambano Atati asagwile ni kunduma pachilambo pa. Kwachichi ŵanyamwe kuusalila, ngwatukana Akunnungu, panguti, uneji ndili Mwana jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Iŵaga ngangupanganya masengo gaasachile Atati ŵangu nagapanganye, nkangulupilila une. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Nambo iŵaga ngugapanganya masengo gao, natamuno munaangulupilile uneji, ngakulupilile masengo gangu. Pelepo chimmanyilile kusyene kuti Atati ali mwangu une ni uneji ndili mwa Atati.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Nipele ŵalinjile sooni kwakamula Che Yesu, nambo ŵalikulupwisye ni kutyoka.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Che Yesu ŵajawile sooni pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, kwiuto kuŵabatisyaga che Yohana ŵandu kula ni kutama kweleko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵanjaulile ni kuti, “Che Yohana nganaapanganya chimanyisyo chachili chose. Nambo yose yaisasile che Yohana nkati mundu ju ili isyene.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Kweleko ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaakulupilile Che Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Mundu jumo jwakuŵilanjikwa che Lasalo juŵatamaga nsinda wa ku Besania ŵaliji jwakulwala. Che Maliamu ni nlumbugwe che Masa ŵatamaga nsinda ulaula. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Che Maliamu ju ni jwejula juŵampakesye mauta ga kununjila Ambuje Che Yesu mmakongolo ni kwasyula ni umbo syakwe. Che Lasalo mpwakwe che Maliamu ni juŵalwalaga. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Nipele achalumbugwe ŵalajisye utenga ku Che Yesu achitiji, “Ambuje, mbusanga gwenu junkunnonyela akulwala!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Che Yesu paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵatite, “Ulwele wo ngaummulaga che Lasalo, nambo ulwele wo ukopochele kwaligongo lya ukulu wa Akunnungu, kuti Mwana jwa Akunnungu apochele ukulu kwa litala lya ulwele wo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Che Yesu ŵaanonyele che Masa ni che Maliamu pamo ni che Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Che Yesu paŵapilikene kuti che Lasalo akulwala, ŵajonjechesye moŵa gane gaŵili ga kutama paŵaliji pala. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Nipele ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Tuujile sooni ku Yudea!” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaasalile, “Jwakwiganya, nganagapite moŵa gamajinji Ŵayahudi ŵasachile kummulaga ni maganga, kwachichi nkusaka tuujile sooni kweleko?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana ngati gapali masaa likumi ni gaŵili ga muusi? Mundu ajendaga muusi ngaakombola kulikuŵala pakuŵa akuliwona lilanguka lya pachilambo chi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nambo mundu ajendaga chilo chalikuŵale pakuŵa lilanguka nganilipagwa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo ŵaasalile, “Mbusanga jwetu che Lasalo agonile, nambo uneji chinyaule kukunjimusya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵansalile, “Ambuje iŵaga agonile chalame.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Che Yesu ŵaŵechetaga nkati chiwa chi che Lasalo, nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaganisyaga kuti che Lasalo agonile. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile pangasisa kuti, “Che Lasalo ajasiche, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />nambo kwa ligongo lyenu ngusengwa, pakuŵa nganima kweleko, kuti ŵanyamwe nkulupilile. Sambano tujaule kwa jwelejo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Che Tomasi jwakuŵilanjikwa Maŵila, ŵaasalile achinjakwe, “Ni uweji tujaule pamo ni Jwakwiganya kuti tukawe pamo nawo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali usyusyo ni umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵaiche kweleko, ŵachisimene chiilu chi che Lasalo chili mwilembe kwa moŵa ncheche. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Nsinda wa ku Besania waŵandichile ku Yelusalemu mpela maili siŵili. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ŵayahudi ŵajinji ŵaiche kukwatusya ntima che Masa ni che Maliamu kwa ligongo lya chiwa cha mpwao.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Nipele che Masa paŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu akwika, ŵajawile kukwachingamila, nambo che Maliamu ŵasigele pamusi. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Che Masa ŵaasalile Che Yesu, “Ambuje, nkaliji papapa pepa mpwangu ngakajasiche. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Nambo, namuno sambano ngumanyilila kuti chachili chose chichimwaŵende Akunnungu champe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Mpwenu chasyuche.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Che Masa ŵajanjile, “Ngumanyilila kuti chachisyuka pa lyuŵa lya mbesi Akunnungu pachiŵasyusye ŵandu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Uneji ndili usyusyo ni jungwapa ŵandu umi. Mundu jwakungulupilila uneji atamuno ajasikaga, chakole umi, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />ni mundu jwalijose jwakutama ni kungulupilila une ngajasika sooni. Uli nkugakulupilila gelego?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Che Masa ŵansalile Che Yesu, “Elo Ambuje! Ngukulupilila kuti ŵalakwe ni Kilisito, Mwana jwa Akunnungu, ŵakwika pa chilambo pano.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Che Masa paŵaŵechete yeleyo ŵajinjile nkati ni kwaŵilanga che Maliamu mlumbugwe ni kwasalila chipasipasi, “Jwakwiganya aiche ni sooni akumbilanga.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Nombe che Maliamu paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵajimwiche kwakwanguya ni kwajaulila Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Che Yesu ŵaliji nganajinjile mu nsinda, nambo ŵaliji kulakula kuŵachingamilwe ni che Masa. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Nipele, Ŵayahudi ŵaŵaliji nkati ali nkwatulasya ntima che Maliamu, paŵambweni che Maliamu ajimwiche ni pangakaŵa akopweche paasa, ŵaakuiye. Ŵaganisisye kuti akwaula kumalembe kukulila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Nipele, che Maliamu paŵaiche paŵaliji Che Yesu pala ni paŵambweni Che Yesu, ŵatindiŵele ni kwasalila, “Ambuje, nkaliji papapa pepa mpwangu ngakajasiche!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Che Yesu paŵambweni che Maliamu ali nkulila, ni Ŵayahudi ŵaŵalongene ni che Maliamu nombe akulila, Che Yesu ŵasupwiche nnope ni kupwa ntima. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Nipele ŵausisye, “Ana mummisile kwapi?” Ni ŵansalile, “Ambuje, njise kunnole.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Che Yesu ŵalisile. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵatite, “Nnole yatite pakunnonyela!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Nambo ŵandu ŵane ŵatite, “Iŵaga ŵagalamisye meeso ga jwangalola jula, kwachichi nganakombola kuntenda che Lasalo anajasiche?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunsyusya che Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Nipele Che Yesu akuno ali nkusupuka sooni mu ntima mwao, ŵaiche pa lilembe. Lilembe lyene lyaliji mbugu lyaliunichikwe ni liganga. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Che Yesu ŵasalile, “Ngalambule liganga lyo!” Che Masa alumbugwe jwajasiche jo, ŵaasalile, “Ambuje, atandite kununga, pakuŵa atemi mwilembe moŵa ncheche!” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Che Yesu ŵansalile che Masa, “Ana nganinansalila kuti mwakulupililaga chimuuwone ukulu wa Akunnungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Nipele ŵagalambwile liganga lila. Che Yesu ŵalolite kwinani ni ŵatite, “Atati nguntogolela pakuŵa mmwejo nkuumbilikanila. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />None ngumanyilila kuti nkuumbilikanila moŵa gose. Nambo ŵechete yelei ligongo lyao ŵandu ŵasongangene pelepa ŵa kuti akulupilile kuti mmwejo mundumile une!” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo, ŵaŵilasile kwaliloŵe lyekulungwa, “Che Lasalo! Nkopoche paasa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Juŵajasiche jo ŵakopweche paasa akuno ali ataŵikwe saanda mmakongolo ni makono ni ku meeso. Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵandu, “Mummugule, munneche ajaule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵayahudi akwilana kwaulaga Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵajinji ŵaŵaiche ku che Maliamu paŵaiweni yaitesile Che Yesu yo, ŵakulupilile. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Nambo ŵandu ŵane mwa ŵelewo ŵajawile kwa Mafalisayo ni kwasalila aila yaitesile Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Achakulu ŵambopesi ni Mafalisayo ŵausimanisye Nkungulu wekulu wa Ŵayahudi, ŵaliusisye, “Tutende chichi? Pakuŵa mundu ju akupanganya imanyisyo yejinji.<figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Jwambopesi jwa Chiyahudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Twannekaga ajendelechele, ŵandu wose chankulupilile, ni achakulu ŵa Chiloma chaiche kukujijonanga Nyuumba jetu ja Akunnungu ni ŵandu ŵetu ni chilambo chetu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Pelepo jumo jwao jwakuŵilanjikwa che Kayafa, chele chaka cho ŵaliji Jwambopesi Jwankulu, ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe ngankumanyilila kose! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ana ngankuganisya kuti ikuŵajilwa mundu jumo ŵawile ŵandu wose, kupunda chijonanjikwe chilambo chose?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ŵelewo nganaŵecheta yeleyo kwa kusaka kwakwe nsyene, nambo ligongo ŵaliji Jwambopesi Jwankulu chele chaka cho, ŵalondwele kuti Che Yesu chawe kwa ligongo lya ŵandu ŵa chilambo cha Ŵayahudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />sooni ngaŵa kwa Ŵayahudi pe nambo kuti ŵasonganganye pamo ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu ŵaŵapwilingene mwinemwine kuti aŵe chindu chimo.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Nipele kutandilila lyuŵa lyo achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵajilene kwaulaga Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kwa yele, Che Yesu nganajendajendaga sooni kwa kulilosya pasikati ja Ŵayahudi, nambo ŵatyosile pelepo, ŵajawile kwiuto kwakuŵandikene ni lipululu, musi waukuŵilanjikwa Eflaimu. Ŵatemi kweleko pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya Pasaka ja Ŵayahudi lyaŵandichile, ni ŵandu ŵajinji ŵakwesile kwaula ku Yelusalemu kuti aliswejesye kwaligongo lya kwapopelela Akunnungu, likanaŵe lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Nipele ŵaliji nkwasosa Che Yesu. Nombewo paŵasongangene pamo pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵausyene, “Ana nkuganisya uli? Nkuti ngaaika ku chindimba chi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Achakulu ŵambopesi ni Mafalisayo ŵalajisye kuti iŵaga kwana mundu jwakumanyi kwali Che Yesu, asale kuti ŵaakamule.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Che Maliamu akumpakasya Che Yesu mauta gakununjila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Moŵa nsano ni limo likanaŵe lyuŵa lya chindimba cha Pasaka, Che Yesu ŵaiche ku Besania, paŵatamaga che Lasalo, mundu juŵasyuchikwe ni Che Yesu jula. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Kweleko ŵankolochesye Che Yesu chakulya cha ligulo ni che Masa ŵaliji nkwatumichila. Che Lasalo ŵaliji jumo jwao jwa ŵeŵala ŵaŵatemi pa chakulya pamo ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Nipele, che Maliamu ŵajigele chuupa cha mauta gambone gakununjila ga ntengo wekulungwa gagakolochekwe ni chitela chachikuŵilanjikwa nado, ni kwapakasya Che Yesu mmakongolo mwao ni ŵagasyusile makongolo ni umbo syakwe. Nyuumba jose janunjile chambone. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Nambo che Yuda Isikaliote, jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao juchiŵagalauche Che Yesu ŵatite, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ana ligongo chi pangagasumisya mauta go kwa ipaande selasini ya feza, ni feza syo kwapa ŵakulaga?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ŵaŵechete yeleyo, ngaŵa kuti ŵaakolelaga chanasa ŵakulaga, nambo ŵaŵechete yeleyo kwa ligongo ŵaliji jwakugosa mbiko. Pakuŵa ŵaliji jwawiyi ŵajiŵaga kutyochela mu mbiko jo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵatite, “Munansausye jwankongwe ju! Munneche, atesile yelei kwa ligongo lya lyuŵa lya masiko gangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ŵakulaga chaŵe pamo ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose, nambo uneji nguŵa ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achakulu ŵambopesi akwilana kummulaga che Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Ŵayahudi ŵajinji ŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu ŵaliji ku Besania. Nipele, ŵaiche kweleko ngaŵa kuti kwa ligongo lya kwawona Che Yesu pe, nambo ŵasachile kwawona che Lasalo nombe, mundu juŵasyusikwe ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Nipele, achakulu ŵambopesi ŵajilene kwaulaga che Lasalo nombe, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ni kwaligongo lya iyankopochele che Lasalo, Ŵayahudi ŵajinji ŵaakanile ilongola ŵao, ni kunkulupilila Che Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwinjila ku Yelusalemu kwa sangalala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Malaŵi jakwe, mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu uwaiche kuchindimba cha Pasaka ŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu ali mwitala kwika ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Nipele, ŵajigele nyambi sya itela ya mitende ni ŵajawile kukwachingamila, ŵanyanyisye achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Alapikwe Akunnungu! Akole upile ŵelewo ŵakwika mu liina lya Ambuje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Akole upile mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Che Yesu ŵampatile mwanambunda, ŵakwesile mpela iyalembekwe Mmalembelo Gamaswela,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Munajogope ŵandu ŵankutama ku Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Nnole, Mwenye jwenu akwika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">akwesile mwanambunda!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Kundanda ŵakulijiganya ŵao nganaimanyililaga indu iyatyochele, nambo paŵasyuchile Che Yesu ni kukuswa, pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵagakumbuchile Malembelo ga Akunnungu apala pagasasile yankati ŵelewo, ni ŵandu iŵatite pakumpanganyichisya.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Mpingo wa ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pamo ni Che Yesu paŵambilasile che Lasalo kutyochela mwilembe ni kwasyusya, ŵasalile ŵandu aila indu iyatendekwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Nipele, mpingo wa ŵandu ula wajawile kukwachingamila, pakuŵa wose ŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu apanganyisye chimanyisyo cho. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Nipele, Mafalisayo ŵaŵechetesyene jwine ni jwine achitiji, “Nnole! Ngatukukombola kupanganya chachili chose! Ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo akunkuya.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵagiliki ŵampepe akusaka kummona Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kwaliji ni Ŵagiliki ŵampepe mwa ŵandu ŵaŵaiche ku Yelusalemu kukupopela katema ka chindimba cha Pasaka chila. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ŵanyawo ŵajaulile che Filipo, juŵatyochele musi wa ku Besesaida chilambo cha ku Galilaya ni kwasalila, “Achimwene, tukusaka twawone Che Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Che Filipo ŵajawile kukwasalila che Andulea, ni wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵajawile kukwasalila Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Saa jiiche ja Mwana jwa Mundu kukuswa! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ngunsalila isyene lusongolo lwa ngano chilusigalile kuŵa lusongolo lwa ngano pe, iŵaga nganilugwa paasi ni kuwa. Nambo lwawaga, lukumela ni kusogosya songolo sine syejinji. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mundu jwakuunonyela umi wakwe, jwelejo chausoyasye, nambo jwakusaka kuutyosya umi wakwe kwa Kilisito mu chilambo chi, jwelejo chaugose mpaka pachapegwe umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Mundu jwakusaka kuundumichila, anguye, kuti papalipose pachime une ni katumetume jwangu ni pachaaŵe. Mundu jwalijose jwakuundumichila uneji, Atati ŵangu chamchimbichisye.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukunguluchila yankati chiwa chao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Sambano Mbumu jangu jikusupuka, none ana mechete chichi? Ana mechete kuti, ‘Atati ŵangu mungulupusye ni ichitendekwe pa katema ka?’ Ngwamba, chelecho ni chinaichile, mbite pa katema ka masausyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Atati, nlikusye liina lyenu.” Pelepo lyapikaniche liloŵe kutyochela kwinani lichitiji, “Nalikusisye, ni chinalikusye sooni.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mpingo wa ŵandu ŵaŵajimi pelepo ŵapilikene liloŵe lyo ni ŵane mwa ŵelewo ŵatite kwaliji ni kulindima ni ŵane ŵatite, “Katumetume jwa kwinani ŵaŵechete nawo!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Liloŵe limwalipikene nganiliŵa kwa ligongo lyangu une, nambo kwa ligongo lyenu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Keleka kali katema ka kwalamula ŵandu ŵa chilambo chi, sambano Shetani jwakutawala pa chilambo chi chaŵinjikwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nambo une pachinyakulikwe pachilambo, wose chinautile kukwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Kwa kuŵecheta yeleyo ŵalosilye chiwa chachi chichawe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mpingo wa ŵandu ula wajanjile, “Uweji tupilikene Mmalajisyo getu kuti Kilisito chatame moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Mmwe nkuti uli, Mwana jwa Mundu aŵajilwe kunyakulwa? Ana aju Mwana jwa Mundu ju ali ŵaani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Lilanguka lili pamo ni ŵanyamwe kwa moŵa kanandi. Njendeje katema lilanguka lyo lili lipali kuti chinansimane chipi, pakuŵa jwakwenda mu chipi ngakukumanyilila kwakwaula. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Katema nli nkwete lilanguka lyo nkulupilile lilanguka lyo mmeje ŵandu ŵa lilanguka.” Paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo Che Yesu ŵatyosile ni kulisisa.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵayahudi akukananga kwakulupilila Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Namuno Che Yesu ŵaitendekenye imanyisyo yo mmbujo mwao, nambo ŵanyawo nganiŵakulupilila. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Nipele maloŵe gaŵaŵechete jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Isaya gamaliile paŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Ambuje, ana ŵaani ŵaukulupilile utenga wetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Ni machili ga Ambuje gawoneche kwa ŵaani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Nambo nganakombola kukulupilila, pakuŵa che Isaya ŵasasile sooni kuti,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Akunnungu ŵaatatesye meeso gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">kuti akalola ni meeso gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">sooni nalyungesye lunda lwao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">kuti akaimanyilila ni lunda lwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">akapitikwisye mitima jao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">kuti nalamye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Che Isaya ŵaŵechete yeleyo pakuŵa ŵauweni ukulu u Che Yesu ni kunkunguluchila ngani syao.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Natamuno yeleyo, achakulu ŵajinji ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵaakulupilile Che Yesu. Nambo kwa ligongo lya kwajogopa Mafalisayo, nganajitichisya kwakulilosya kuti akaaŵinga mu nyuumba jakupopelela. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Pakuŵa yanonyele kulapikwa ni ŵandu kupunda kulapikwa ni Akunnungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liloŵe lyakwe Che Yesu chilyalamule ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Mundu jwakungulupilila une, ngakungulupilila une pe, nambo akwakulupilila iyoyo ŵeŵala ŵandumile une. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Jwakumona une akwawona iyoyo ŵeŵala ŵandumile une. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Uneji iiche pachilambo meje lilanguka kuti ŵanawose ŵakungulupilila une akatama mu chipi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mundu jwakugapilikana maloŵe gangu nambo ngakugakamulisya, uneji ngaŵa juchinanlamule. Nguniika kukwalamula ŵandu ŵa pachilambo nambo iiche kukwakulupusya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Jwakungana une ni kugakana maloŵe gangu jwelejo akwete jwakwalamula. Liloŵe limechete lila chilyalamule pa lyuŵa lya mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nganiŵecheta kwa malamulo gangu nansyene, nambo Atati ŵangu ŵandumile ŵelewo ni ŵanajisye chakuŵecheta ni chakwasalila ŵandu. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Ni uneji ngumanyilila kuti malamulo gakwe gakwikanawo umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Nipele uneji nguŵecheta agala pe gaŵanajisye Atati ŵangu kuti nagaŵechete.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakunda makongolo ŵakulijiganya ŵao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Lyaliji likanaŵe lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya Pasaka. Che Yesu achimanyililaga kuti katema kao kakutyoka pachilambo chino ni kwaula kwa Atati ŵao kaiche. Moŵa gose ŵanonyele ŵandu ŵao ŵaali pachilambo, elo, ŵanonyele kwa unonyelo wangali mbesi!<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Nipele Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵatemi achilyaga chakulya cha ligulo. Jwakulinga ŵamasile kwajinjila che Yuda, mwana ju che Simoni Isikaliote ni kwapa nganisyo sya kwagalauka Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Che Yesu ŵaimanyi kuti Atati ŵao aŵisile indu yose paasi pa ulamusi wakwe, ni kuti nsyene ŵatyosile kwa Akunnungu ni akuuja kwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Nipele, ŵatyosile pachakulya pala, ŵawusile likoti lyakwe ni kuŵika pambali, ŵajigele chitambaa ni kulitaŵa mchiunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Nipele ŵatechile meesi mu nkambo wa mwana ni kutanda kwakunda makongolo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni kwasyula ni chitambaa chiŵalitawile mchiunu chila. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Paŵaiche ku che Simoni Petulo, jwelejo ŵammusisye Che Yesu, “Ambuje, ana mmwe nkusaka kuungunda makongolo gangu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ngankuchimanya chingupanganya sambano, nambo chinchimanye kanyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Che Petulo ŵansalile Che Yesu, “Mmwe ngamungunda makongolo gangu kose.” Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Iŵaga ngangugakunda makongolo genu, mmwejo ngamma jwakulijiganya jwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Che Simoni Petulo ŵanjanjile, “Ambuje, mungunde, ngaŵa makongolo pe, nambo ni makono gangu ni ntwe wangu nombe nawo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Jwanjoje amasile kusalala, akusachilwa kulikunda mmakongolo pe. Ŵanyamwe nsalele, ikaŵe mundu jumo pe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Che Yesu ŵammanyilile ajula juchiŵagalauche, kwa ligongo lyo ŵatite, “Ŵanyamwe nsalele, ikaŵe mundu jumo pe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Paŵamalisisye kwakunda makongolo gao, ŵawasile likoti lyakwe, ŵatemi sooni ni kwausya, “Ana nchimanyi chele chindesile kukwenu cho? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Ŵanyamwe nkuumilanga une Jwakwiganya ni Ambuje, nkuŵecheta uchenene, pakuŵa yeleyo ni indite pakuŵa. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Nipele iŵaga uneji jundi Ambuje ni Jwakwiganya, nankundile makongolo genu ni ŵanyamwe nkuŵajilwa nkundane makongolo jwine ni jwine. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nampele chitagu chi, kuti ni ŵanyamwe mpanganyeje iyoyo mpela inampanganyichisye ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ngunsalila isyene, ngapagwa kapolo jwakumpunda mmbujegwe, atamuno ngapagwa jwakutumichila jwakumpunda jwantumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Nipele iŵaga ngamanyi gelego, chinkole upile iŵaga chingatende.”<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Ginguŵecheta ga ngaŵa kwa ŵanyamwe ŵanawose. Uneji ngwamanyilila yatite pakuŵa ŵanawose unasagwile ŵala. Nambo gakusachilwa gamalile Malembelo ga Akunnungu gagakuti, ‘Mundu jwakulya chakulya pamo ni uneji amujilile nkusa.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Uneji nansalile gelega sambano gakanaŵe kopochela, kuti pachigakopochele po nkulupilile kuti, ‘Uneji ndili jwelejo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ngunsalila isyene, mundu jwalijose juchampochele junguntuma, jwelejo akumbochela ni une, ni mundu jwakumbochela uneji akumpochela jwele jwandumile une.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunlondola mundu juchangalauche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo ŵasupwiche nnope mmbumu jao, ŵaŵechete pangasisa kuti, “Ngunsalila isyene, jumo jwenu chang'alauche!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵalolegene anakombole kwimanyilila kuti ŵagambaga ŵaani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao juŵanonyelwe nnope ni Che Yesu, ŵatemi pachiŵandi ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Nipele che Simoni Petulo ŵankupilile jwakulijiganya jula kunsalila, “Mwausye ana akwagamba ŵaani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Jwakulijiganya jo ŵammandichile nnope Che Yesu ni kwausya, “Ambuje ana ŵaani nkwagamba?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Jwelejo ni ajula juchinampambile chipande cha nkate ni kwapa.” Nipele ŵajigele chipande cha nkate, ni kupamba mu mbaale, ŵampele che Yuda mwana ju che Simoni Isikaliote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Che Yuda napochelape chipande cho, ŵajinjilwe ni Shetani. Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Chinkusaka kuchipanganya, nchipanganye chitema pe!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nambo ngapagwa mundu jwalijose mwa aŵala ŵaŵatemi pachakulya pala juŵaimanyilile ligongo lya kwasalila yeleyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Pakuŵa che Yuda ŵaliji jwakugosa mbiko, ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵaganisisye kuti Che Yesu ŵaasalile che Yuda kuti ajaule akasume indu yaikusachilwa ku chindimba cha Pasaka, pane ŵaasalile kuti akapeleganye chachili chose kwa ŵakulaga.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Nipele, che Yuda napochelape chipande cha nkate chila, ŵakopweche paasa. Ni kele katema ko kaliji chilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajisyo ga sambano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Che Yuda paŵakopweche, Che Yesu ŵatite, “Sambano Mwana jwa Mundu apatile ukulu, ni Akunnungu nombe apatile ukulu mwa jwelejo. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Iŵaga ukulu wa Akunnungu uwunukwiche kwa litala lya Mwana jwa Mundu, nipele Akunnungu asyene chauunukule ukulu wa Mwana jwa Mundu, nombewo chiŵakusye chitema pe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Achiŵanangu, ndili ni ŵanyamwe kwa moŵa kanandi pe. Chimuusose, nambo sambano ngunsalila aila inaasalile achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi kuti, ‘Kungwaula ŵanyamwe ngankombolanga kwika!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Malajisyo ga sambano ngumpanga gati nnonyelane jwine ni jwine. Mpela indite pakunnonyela ŵanyamwe, kwanti iyoyo peyo nnonyelane jwine ni jwine. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mwanonyelanaga jwine ni jwine, ŵandu ŵanawose chachimanyilila kuti ŵanyamwe ndi ŵakulijiganya ŵangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulondola kuti chakanikwe ni che Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Che Simoni Petulo ŵambusisye Che Yesu, “Ana Ambuje nkwenda kwapi?” Ni Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Kungwaula sambano ngankombola kuunguya, nambo chimuunguye kanyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Che Petulo ŵansalile, “Ambuje, ligongo chi lichilepele kunkuya sambano? Ndili chile kuwa kwa ligongo lyenu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana isyene ndi chile kuwa kwa ligongo lyangu une? Isyene ngunsalila, jikanaŵe kutongola tambala chimuungane katatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali litala lya kwaula kwa Atati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nkapotekwa mmitima jenu. Mwakulupilile Akunnungu ni mungulupilile une ŵakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ku nyuumba ja Atati kwana yuumba yejinji, ngaikaŵe yeleyo, ngansalile. Sambano ngwaula kukunkolochesya liuto. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Najaulaga ni kunkolochesya liuto, chingauje ni kunjigala, kuti pandili une, ni ŵanyamwe mbe pelepo. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Kungwaula ko nkulimanyilila litala lyakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Che Tomasi ŵambusisye, “Ambuje, ngatukumanyilila kunkwaula ko, ana tutukombole chinauli kulimanyilila litala lyakwe?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Uneji ndili litala ni usyene ni umi usyene. Ngapagwa mundu jwakwaula kwa Atati pangapitila kwa uneji. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Iŵaga nkuumanyilila uneji, Atati ŵangu nombe mwamanyi. Chitandile sambano, mwamanyi, ni sooni mwaweni.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Che Filipo ŵansalile, “Ambuje, ntulosye Atati, chelecho ni chitukuchisaka.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Che Filipo, ndemi ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose ga, ngunnaŵe kuumanyilila? Mundu jwalijose jwamweni une, ŵaweni Atati. Ana kwachichi nkuti, ‘Ntulosye Atati?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ana ngankukulupilila kuti uneji ndili mwa Atati, nombe Atati ali mwa uneji? Gelega maloŵe gingunsalila ga nganguŵecheta kwa ulamusi wangu nansyene, nambo Atati ŵakutama mwangu une akupanganya masengo gao. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nkusachilwa kukulupilila pinguti, uneji ndili mwa Atati nombe Atati ali mwa uneji. Naga ngaŵa yele, nkulupilile kwa ligongo lya masengo gingugapanganya go. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ngunsalila isyene, jwakungulupilila uneji chagapanganye masengo gingugapanganya une. Elo, chagapanganye namose masengo gamakulungwa kupunda agaga, ligongo uneji ngwaula kwa Atati. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ni ŵanyamwe mwaŵendaga chachilichose mu liina lyangu chinampanganyichisye, kuti Atati apate ukulu kwa litala lya Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mwamendaga chachilichose kwa ukombole wa liina lyangu, chinampanganyichisye.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akusala kuti chiŵape Mbumu jwa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Mwanonyelaga uneji, chingajitichisye malajisyo gangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Uneji chinaachondelele Atati nombewo chachimpanga Nkamusi jwine, jwelejo chatame ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Jwelejo ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu jwakutusalila ngani sya usyene nkati Akunnungu. Ŵandu ŵa pachilambo pano ngaakombola kumpochela jwelejo pakuŵa ngakukombola kumbona atamuno kummanyilila. Nambo ŵanyamwe nkummanyilila ligongo akutama ni ŵanyamwe ni sooni ali nkati mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Pachindyoche nginanneka jika mpela ŵandu ŵakulekwa, nambo chinjiika sooni kukwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Gasigele moŵa kanandi ŵandu ŵa pachilambo pano ngaawona uneji sooni, nambo ŵanyamwe chimuuwone. Pakuŵa uneji ngwete umi, nombe ŵanyamwe chinkole umi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Lyuŵa lyo pachiliiche chinchimanyilila kuti uneji ndili mwa Atati ŵangu, nombe ŵanyamwe ndi mwangu une, ni uneji ndili mwa ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Jwapochele malajisyo gangu ni kugatendekanya, jwelejo ni jwakuunonyela une. Nombe jwakuunonyela une chanonyelwe ni Atati ŵangu ni uneji chinjinnonyela ni kulimanyukusya kwa jwelejo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Che Yuda, jwanganaŵa Isikaliote, ŵausisye, “Ambuje, ana chiikomboleche chinauli nlimanyisye kukwetu pe ni ngaŵa kwa ŵandu ŵa chilambo chose?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Mundu jwalijose anonyelaga une chagakamulisye majiganyo gangu, ni Atati ŵangu chanonyelwe ni mundu jo, une ni Atati ŵangu chituiche kukuŵika ndamo kukwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mundu jwangakuunonyela une ngakugajitichisya majiganyo gangu. Majiganyo ginkugapilikana go ngaŵa gangu, nambo gakutyochela kwa Atati ŵandumile.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Ayiyi nansalile ndili chiŵela pamo ni ŵanyamwe, <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />nambo nkamusi jo, jwelejo Mbumu jwa Akunnungu juchalajiswe ni Atati ŵangu kwa liina lyangu, chachinjiganya indu yose ni kunkumbusya yose inansalile.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Ngunlechelanga chitendewele, chitendewele changu ngumpanga. Ngangumpanga ŵanyamwe mpela ila ŵandu ŵa pachilambo iyakuti pakupanganya. Nkapotekwa mmitima jenu, natamuno nkajogopa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Ana ngati mwapilikene njinsalilaga kuti, ‘Ngwaula, nipele chinjimmujilila.’ Nkaanonyele nkasangalele ligongo ngwaula kwa Atati ŵangu, pakuŵa ŵelewo ali ŵakulungwa kumbunda une. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nansalile gelega sambano gakanaŵe kopochela, kuti pachigakopochele po nkulupilile. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nguuŵecheta sooni maloŵe gamajinji ni ŵanyamwe, pakuŵa Shetani, chilongola jwa chilambo chi akwika. Nambo nganakola machili kukwangu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />nambo ŵandu ŵa pachilambo amanyilile kuti ngwanonyela Atati. Kwa ligongo lyo ngupanganya yailiyose mpela Atati iŵatite pakuulajisya. Njimanje tutyoche pelepa!<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali Msabibu Usyenesyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Uneji ndili chitela chisyenesyene cha msabibu, ni Atati ŵangu ali jwakulima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Lujambi lwaluli lose lwaluli mwangu une lwangalukusogola akulutyosya ni lujambi lwaluli lose lwalukusogola akulupogolela kuti lupunde kusogola. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ŵanyamwe mmasile kuŵa ŵasalele kwa ligongo lya majiganyo gangu ginansalile. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ntame nkati mwangu, ni uneji chindame nkati mwenu. Mpela ila lujambi ngalukombola kusogola isogosi iŵaga nganilusigala pa msabibu usyene, iyoyo peyo ni ŵanyamwe iŵaga ngankutama munkati mwangu chinnepele kusogola isogosi.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Uneji ndili mpela chitela cha msabibu ni ŵanyamwe ndi nyambi. Jwakutama mwa uneji, ni uneji mwa jwelejo, jwelejo chasogole isogosi yejinji, pakuŵa ŵanyamwe jikape ngankukombola kupanganya chachili chose. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mundu jwalijose iŵaga ngakutama mwa uneji akulandana ni lujambi lwalujasikwe kwakutalichila ni kuumula. Syele nyambi sikukumbikwa ni kutinisya pa mooto ni kutinika. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mwatamaga mwa uneji ni maloŵe gangu gatamaga nkati mwenu, mmende chachili chose chinkuchisaka ni ŵanyamwe chimpegwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Mwasogolaga isogosi yejinji, Atati ŵangu chakuswe ni ŵanyamwe chimme ŵakulijiganya ŵangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Uneji nannonyele ŵanyamwe mpela ila Atati ŵangu iŵanonyele une. Ntameje mu unonyelo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mwagakamulichisyaga malajisyo gangu chintame mu unonyelo wangu, mpela ila indite pakugakamulichisya malajisyo ga Atati ŵangu ni kutama mu unonyelo wao.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Nansalile yelei yose kuti usangalale wangu utame nkati mwenu, ni usangalale wenu upunde. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Alili lili lilajisyo lyangu: Nnonyelane jwine ni jwine mpela indite pakunnonyela ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ngapangwa unonyelo wauli wekulungwa kuupunda unonyelo wa mundu jwakuutyosya umi wakwe kwa ligongo lya achambusanga ŵao. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ŵanyamwe ndi achambusanga ŵangu mwatendaga chele chingunnajisya. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Uneji ngangummilanga sooni ŵakutumichila, pakuŵa jwakutumichila ngakuchimanyilila chakupanganya mmbujegwe. Nambo uneji nammilasile ŵanyamwe achambusanga ŵangu, pakuŵa nammanyisye yose inaipilikene kutyochela kwa Atati ŵangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ŵanyamwe nganimuusagula uneji, nambo uneji nansagwile ŵanyamwe ni kuntuma njaule nkasogole isogosi yejinji yaani ipanganyo yambone, ichitame moŵa gose, nipele chachili chose chachimwaŵende Atati ŵangu kwa liina lyangu chimpegwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Nipele, lilajisyo lyangu kukwenu lili ali, nnonyelane jwine ni jwine.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵa pachilambo akwachima ŵakulijiganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Iŵaga ŵandu ŵa pachilambo pano akunchima ŵanyamwe, mmanyilile kuti akanaŵe kunchima ŵanyamwe, ŵanjimile uneji kaje. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Nkaliji ŵandu ŵa pachilambo, ŵandu akunnonyela ŵanyamwe mpela achinjao. Ŵanyamwe nganimma ŵandu ŵa pachilambo, nambo une nansagwile ŵanyamwe pasikati ja ŵandu ŵa pachilambo. Kwa ligongo lyo ŵandu ŵa pachilambo akunchima ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Nkumbuchile inansalile yo kuti, ‘Jwakutumichila nganaŵa jwankulungwa kumpunda mmbujegwe.’ Iŵaga ŵalagesye uneji, ni ŵanyamwe nombe chanlagasye, agakamulichisyaga majiganyo gangu, ni majiganyo genu chagakamulisye. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Nambo champanganyichisye ŵanyamwe yeleyo yose pakuŵa ŵanyamwe ndi ŵandu ŵangu, ligongo ngakwamanyilila ŵelewo ŵandumile une. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ngungaiche ni kuŵecheta nawo, ngakaŵe ni sambi, nambo sambano ngakukombola kulichenjela kuti nganakola sambi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Jwakunjima une, akwachima Atati ŵangu nombe. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ngangapanganye kukwao masengo ganganagapanganye jwine, ngaakakole sambi, nambo sambano aiweni yakusimonjeka indesile, ali chiŵela kutuchima une ni Atati ŵangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Nambo itendekwe yele kuti gamalile maloŵe gagalembekwe Mmalajisyo gao gagakuti, ‘Ŵanjimile pangali ligongo.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Chinantume nkamusi kutyochela kwa Atati ŵangu, jwele ali Mbumu jwa Akunnungu, juchasale usyene nkati Akunnungu. Chinantume kukwenu kutyochela kwa Atati kuti ansalile usyene nkati uneji. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ni ŵanyamwe nombe chimwasalile ŵandu nkati une pakuŵa ntemi pamo ni une chitandile kundanda.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nansalile yelei kuti nkaleka kukulupilila kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Ŵandu chamminje ŵanyamwe mmajumba gao gakupopelela. Sooni chikaiche katema kanti jwalijose juchambulaje pasikati ja ŵanyamwe chaganisye kuti akwatyosyesya Akunnungu mbopesi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Chantende yeleyo pakuŵa ngakwamanyilila Atati natamuno ngakuumanyilila uneji. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Nambo, nansalile yelei kuti pachikaiche katema ka kukopochela nkumbuchile kuti nansalile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Masengo ga Mbumu jwa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Nganinansalila yelei kutyochela kundanda pakuŵa naliji pamo ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nambo sambano ngwaula kwa ŵandumile une ŵala, ni ngapagwa namuno jumo jwenu jwakumusya kuti, ‘Nkwaula kwapi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Pakuŵa nansalile yelei nsupwiche mmitima jenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Nambo ngunsalila isyene, kwa liwamba lyenu mmbaya uneji nyaule, pakuŵa iŵaga ngunyaula, nkamusi jo ngaika kukwenu. Nambo najaulaga, chingantume kukwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nombewo pachaiche, chachamanyisya ŵandu ŵa pachilambo chi kuti ngakuumanyilila usyene nkati sambi ni nkati kupanganya yambone paujo pa Akunnungu ni nkati ŵandu kulamulikwa ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ngakuumanyilila usyene nkati sambi ligongo nganangulupilila une. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Ngakuumanyilila usyene nkati kupanganya yambone paujo pa Akunnungu, ligongo ngwaula kwa Atati ŵangu ni ŵanyamwe ngamuuwona sooni. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Ngakuumanyilila usyene nkati ŵandu kulamulikwa ni Akunnungu, ligongo Shetani jwakutawala chilambo chi amasile kulamulikwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Ngwete yejinji yakunsalila, nambo sambano chinnepele kwipililila. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Nambo pachaiche Mbumu jwa Akunnungu juchansalile usyene nkati Akunnungu, chachinlongosya mu usyene wose. Ngaasala kwa ulamusi wakwe nsyene nambo chachisala ichaipilikane kutyochela kwa Atati ni kummanyisya ichiiche. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ŵelewo changusye une ligongo chachinsalila yeila ichinansalile une. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Yose yalinayo Atati ŵangu ili yangu une, kwa ligongo lyo sasile kuti Mbumu jo chachinsalila ichinaasalile une.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusupuka ni kusangalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Gasigele moŵa kanandi ni ŵanyamwe ngamuuwona sooni, ni pakumala moŵa kanandi, chimuuwone sooni!” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵampepe ŵausyene, “Malumbo gakwe chichi pakutusalila, ‘Gasigele moŵa kanandi ni ŵanyamwe ngamuuwona sooni, ni pakumala moŵa kanandi, chimuuwone sooni?’ Ni sooni ŵatite, ‘Pakuŵa ngwaula kwa Atati ŵangu!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Nipele, ŵajendelechele kuusyana, “Ana malumbo gakwe chichi pakuŵecheta, ‘Gasigele moŵa kanandi?’ Ngatukuchimanyilila chakuchigamba cho.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Che Yesu ŵaimanyi kuti ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵasachile kwausya yankati yeleyo, nipele ŵaasalile, “Ana nkuusyana nkati yeila imechete kuti, ‘Gasigele moŵa kanandi ni ŵanyamwe ngamuuwona sooni, ni pakumala moŵa kanandi, chimuuwone sooni?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ngunsalila isyene, ŵanyamwe chinlile ni kulila kwa malumbo, nambo ŵandu ŵa pachilambo pano chasangalale. Ŵanyamwe chinsupuche nambo kusupuka kwenu chikugalauche kusangalala. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Katema ka kuligopola jwankongwe chikwasimana chilungusi ligongo katema kakwe ka kupeteka kaiche, nambo aligopolaga mwanache ngakukumbuchilila kupeteka kula, nambo akusangalala pakuŵa apagwile mwanache mchilambo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nombe ŵanyamwe sambano nkusupuka, nambo pachinambone sooni chinsangalale mmitima jenu ni sangalala jo ngapagwa jwalijose juchakombole kujityosya kukwenu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Lyele lyuŵa lyo ngamuusya chachili chose. Ngunsalila isyene, chachili chose chachimwaŵende Atati champe kwa liina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Natamuno sambano nganimmende chachili chose kwa liina lyangu. Mmende ni ŵanyamwe chinchipata kuti sangalale jenu jimalile.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu achipundile chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nansalile gelega kwa itagu. Nambo chijiiche ndaŵi jati ngamecheta ni ŵanyamwe sooni kwa itagu, nambo chinansalile pangasisa yankati Atati. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Lyuŵa lyo chinchiŵenda kwa liina lyangu, ni ngangunsalila kuti chisachilwe kummendela kwa Atati, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />pakuŵa Atati asyene akunnonyela ŵanyamwe. Akunnonyela ŵanyamwe ligongo ŵanyamwe muunonyele uneji, ni kukulupilila kuti uneji natyochele kwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Uneji natyochele kwa Atati, ni kwika pachilambo, ni sambano nguchileka chilambo ni kuuja kwa Atati.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaasalile, “Nnole sambano nkuŵecheta pangasisa, ngankuŵecheta kwa itagu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Sambano tuimanyi kuti mmwe nkuimanyilila yose ni ngapagwa ligongo lya mundu jwalijose kummusya, chelecho ni chachikututenda tukulupilile kuti nkopochele kwa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana sambano nkukulupilila? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nnole lyuŵa likwika, sooni liiche lyati chimpwilingane jwalijose kumangwakwe, ni kuuneka jika. Nambo uneji nguuŵa jika, pakuŵa Atati ali pamo ni une. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nansalile gelega kuti nlumbikane ni uneji ni kukola chitendewele. Mchilambo chinsauche, nambo muusimane ntima! Uneji nachipundile chilambo!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwapopelela ŵakulijiganya ŵao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo, ŵalolite kwinani ni kuti, “Atati, katema kaiche. Mwape ukulu Mwana gwenu kuti Mwana gwenu nombe ampe ukulu. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Pakuŵa mwapele Mwana gwenu ulamusi pa ŵandu wose kuti ŵandu wose umwapele ŵape umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ni umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi wo ni au, ŵandu ammanyilile mmwe ŵandi Akunnungu ŵamope ŵa usyene, ni kwamanya Che Yesu Kilisito umwatumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Uneji jwammale kunkusya pachilambo kwa kumalisya masengo gamwambele kuti nagapanganye. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Atati ŵangu, sambano mumbe ukulu paujo penu, ukulu ulaula unakwete pamo nomwe, chikanaŵe gumbikwa chilambo.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nantesile mmanyiche ni ŵandu umwambele pachilambo ŵala. Ŵanyawo ŵaliji ŵenu ni mwambele uneji kuti aŵe ŵangu, nombewo alijitichisye liloŵe lyenu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Sambano ŵanyawo akuimanyilila kuti yose imwambele uneji ityosile kukwenu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Pakuŵa maloŵe gamwambele uneji napele ŵanyawo, ni ŵanyawo akugakulupilila maloŵe go. Akumanyilila kwa isyene kuti natyochele kukwenu, ni sooni ajitichisye kuti mmwe ni jumwandumile une.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Ngwapopelela ŵanyawo. Ngangwapopelela ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo, nambo ŵele umwambele wo pakuŵa ali ŵenu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Wose ungwete ali ŵenu, ni ŵenu ali ŵangu, ni ukulu wangu uwoneche kwa litala lya ŵele umwambele wo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Ni sambano ngwika kukwenu, uneji nguuŵa sooni pachilambo, nambo aŵaŵa alinji pachilambo. Atati ŵangu Ŵaswela mwagose kwa machili ga liina lyenu limumbele, kuti aŵe ŵamo mpela une ni mmwe ituli ŵamo. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Panaliji pamo nawo, une naagosile kwa machili ga liina lyenu limumbele, naagosile ni ngapagwa mundu jwalijose jwasochele ikaŵe ajula juŵasagulikwe kujonasika, kuti Malembelo ga Akunnungu gamalile. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Nambo sambano ngwika kukwenu, nguŵecheta gelega pachilambo kuti ŵanyawo agumbale kusengwa kwangu mmitima jao. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Une napele liloŵe lyenu, ni ŵandu ŵa pachilambo ŵaachimile ŵanyawo pakuŵa ŵanyawo nganaŵa ŵa pachilambo, mpela ila uneji nganima jwa pachilambo. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nganguŵenda kuti mmwe mwatyosye mchilambo, nambo ngupopela mwagose ni Shetani jwaali jwangalumbana. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ŵanyawo nganaŵa ŵa pachilambo pano, uneji nombe nganiŵa jwa pachilambo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Mwatende aŵe ŵandu ŵenu ŵaswela kwa litala lya usyene, liloŵe lyenu lili usyene. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Mpela ila imwatite pakunduma une mchilambo, ni une nombe natumile ŵelewo mchilambo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Une ngulityosya nansyene kwaligongo lyao, kuti nombewo alityosye kusyene kukwenu.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ngangwapopelela ŵanyawo pe, nambo ngwapopelela nombe ŵandu wose ŵachangulupilile kwaligongo lya majiganyo gao. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ngupopela kuti wose aŵe chindu chimo. Atati, ngupopela kuti atame nkati mwetu mpela ila mmwe inkuti kutama nkati mwangu, noneji inguti kutama nkati mwenu. Ngupopela aŵe chindu chimo kuti ŵandu ŵa pachilambo akulupilile kuti mmwe ni jumundumile une. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Noneji naapele ukulu ulaula umwambele uneji, kuti aŵeje ŵamo mpela ila uweji ituli ŵamo. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Uneji ndame mwa ŵanyawo nombe mmwe mwa uneji. Atendekwe kuŵa ŵamo, ni ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo amanyilile kuti mmwe ni jumwandumile ni kuti nkwanonyela ŵelewo mpela inkuti pakunonyela uneji.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Atati, wose umumbele ngusaka aŵeje pamo ni uneji pepala pandili une kuti aulole ukulu wangu, ukulu umumbele ligongo mwanonyele uneji chilambo chikanigumbikwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Atati ŵambone, namuno ŵandu ŵa pachilambo ngakummanya nambo uneji nammanyi. Ŵelewo nombe akumanyilila kuti mmwe mwandumile une. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nantesile mmanyiche kukwao, nombe chimbundisye kutenda yeleyo kuti unonyelo undi nawo kukwangu uŵe mwa ŵanyawo, ni uneji meje mwa ŵanyawo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kupopela, ŵajombweche kasulo ka Keduloni pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao. Pelepo paliji ni ngunda wa mwana, nombe Che Yesu ŵajinjile mwelemo pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Che Yuda, ajula juŵangalawiche Che Yesu, ŵapamanyilile pelepo ligongo kaŵili kaŵili Che Yesu ŵasimene ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao kweleko. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Nipele che Yuda ŵajawile ku wele ngunda wo, ŵajawile pamo ni mpingo wa ŵangondo ŵa Chiloma ni ŵakulindilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵaŵalajiswe ni achakulu ŵambopesi ni Mafalisayo, ali ajigele ibatali ni mimuli ni yakumenyanila. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Che Yesu, akuno achimanyililaga ichiyasimane yose, ŵajaulile ni ŵausisye, “Ana nkwasosa ŵaani?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti!” Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ndili une.” Che Yuda juŵangalawiche jula ŵajimi pelepo pamo ni ŵanyawo.<verse eid="JHN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Nipele Che Yesu paŵaasalile, “Ndili une,” ŵanyawo ŵaujile panyuma ni kugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Che Yesu ŵausisye sooni, “Ana nkwasosa ŵaani?” Ni ŵajanjile, “Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nansalile kuti ndili une. Iŵaga nkuusosa une, mwaleche ŵanyaŵa ajaule.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ŵaŵechete yeleyo kuti gamalile maloŵe gagatite, “Atati, nganinanjasa mundu jwalijose mwa ŵeŵala umwambele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Che Simoni Petulo ŵakwete lipanga, nipele, ŵalisolomwele ni kwakata liwiwi lyao lya kundyo kapolo jwa Jwambopesi Jwankulu. Kapolo jo liina lyakwe che Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile che Petulo, “Mmusye lipanga lyenu mwigonelo mwakwe. Ana nkuganisya kuti nganguŵajilwa kugapata masausyo gaasachile Atati ŵangu kuti nagapate?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali paujo pa che Anasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Wele mpingo wa ŵangondo ŵa Chiloma ni jwankulu jwao pamo ni ŵakulindilila ŵa Chiyahudi ŵankamwile Che Yesu ni kuntaŵa. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Ŵanjigele ni kunjausya kaje ku che Anasi. Che Anasi ŵaliji akwegwao che Kayafa juŵaliji Jwambopesi Jwankulu chele chaka cho. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Che Kayafa ju ni jwejula juŵaasalile achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi kuti, ikuŵajilwa mundu jumo aweje kwaligongo lya ŵandu wose.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Petulo akwakana Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Che Simoni Petulo pamo ni jwakulijiganya jwine ŵakuiye Che Yesu. Jwakulijiganya jwine jo ŵamanyiche ku Jwambopesi Jwankulu, nipele ŵajinjile pamo ni Che Yesu pansana pao Jwambopesi Jwankulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Nambo che Petulo ŵajimi paasa, kuŵandikana ni nnango. Nipele, jwakulijiganya jwine juŵamanyiche kwa Jwambopesi Jwankulu jula ŵakopweche ni kuŵecheta nawo mwali jwakulindilila pannango, ni ŵansalile che Petulo ajinjile nkati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mwali jwakulindilila pannango jula ŵambusisye che Petulo, “Ana mmwejo nganimma jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵa mundu jo?” Che Petulo ŵajanjile, “Ngaŵa une!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Pakuŵa kaliji katema ka mbepo, achikapolo ni ŵakulindilila ŵakolesisye mooto ni ŵaliji nkuotanga. Che Petulo nombejo ŵajimi pamo nawo achijotelaga mooto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu paujo pa Jwambopesi Jwankulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Nipele Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵambusisye Che Yesu nkati ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni sooni nkati majiganyo gao. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Mechete yose pelanga ni ŵandu wose. Moŵa gose najiganisye mmajumba ga kupopelela ni pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, mwakusimanilana Ŵayahudi wose, ni nganimecheta chachili chose kwakulisisa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ligongo chi nkumusya une? Mwausye ŵandu ŵaŵapilikene indu inaasalile. Ŵelewo akwimanyilila inaŵechete.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo jumo jwao ŵakulindilila juŵajimi pelepo ŵamputile Che Yesu lijanda achitiji, “Uli, ana yelei ni inkuti pakunjanga Jwambopesi Jwankulu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga mechete yangalumbana, nlosye changalumbana cho nambo iŵaga mechete yambone ana nkuumbutila ichichi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Nipele che Anasi ŵanjigele Che Yesu ali ataŵikwe ni kunjausya ku che Kayafa Jwambopesi Jwankulu.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Petulo akwakana kaŵili Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Nambo che Simoni Petulo ŵaliji pelepo alinkujotela mooto. Nipele ŵambusisye, “Ana mmwejo nombe nganimma jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao?” Che Petulo ŵakanile ni kuti, “Ngaŵa une!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Jumo jwao achikapolo ŵa Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵaliji pelepo. Jweleju ni nlongo njakwe mundu jula juŵankatile liwiwi ni che Petulo, ŵambusisye, “Ana uneji nganinammona mmwejo mungunda wa mwana pamo ni Che Yesu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Nambo che Petulo ŵakanile sooni, ni papopo tambala jatongwele.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu paujo pa che Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Kundaŵi pe ŵakulindilila ŵanjigele Che Yesu kopoka mu nyuumba ji Che Kayafa, ni kunjausya mu nyuumba ja mwenye jwa Chiloma. Nambo achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi nganajinjila nkati mwa nyuumba ja mwenye jwa Chiloma kuti aŵe ŵaswejele paujo pa Akunnungu kuti akombole kulya chakulya cha Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Che Pilato ŵakopweche paasa ni kwausya, “Ana kwana magambo chi kwa mundu ju?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Mundu ju ngakaŵe ni magambo ngatukannyichenawo kukwenu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Che Pilato ŵaasalile, “Ayaga, munjigale mwachinsyene, nkanlamule ni malajisyo genu.” Ŵayahudi ŵajanjile, “Uweji ngatukuŵajilwa kunlamula mundu jwalijose chiwa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Yatendekwe yeleyo kuti gamalile maloŵe ga Che Yesu gaŵasasile achilosyaga chachiwa chiwa chanti uli.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Che Pilato ŵajinjile sooni mu nyuumba jakwe, ŵammilasile Che Yesu ni kwausya, “Ana mmwejo ni Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana gele maloŵe go genu, pane ŵandu ŵane ansalile ngani jangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Che Pilato ŵajanjile, “Ana nkuganisya uneji ndili Myahudi? Ŵandu ŵenu ni achakulu ŵambopesi annyichisye mmwejo kukwangu. Ana ntesile ichichi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Umwenye wangu nganiuŵa wa pachilambo pano. Ikaŵe umwenye wangu uli wa pachilambo pano, ŵakunguya akatesile ngondo kuti achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi anaangamule. Nambo sambano umwenye wangu nganiuŵa wa pachilambo pa.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pelepo che Pilato ŵammusisye, “Ana mmwejo ndi Mwenye?” Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Mmwe nkuti uneji ndili Mwenye. Kwa ligongo lyo uneji mbagwile ni kwika pachilambo kukwasalila ŵandu usyene. Mundu jwalijose jwakuunonyela usyene akumbilikana.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Che Pilato ŵambusisye, “Usyene ni chichi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Che Pilato akunlamula Che Yesu chiwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Nipele che Pilato ŵakopweche paasa ni kwasalila Ŵayahudi, “Ngangugawona magambo gagaligose ga kunlamula mundu ju. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Nambo nkwete chisyoŵelo chakuti uneji ngungopolela jwantawe jumo katema ka Pasaka. Nipele ana nkusaka nangopolele Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Pelepo ŵanyanyisye, “Ngaŵa, ngaŵa ajuju! Tukwasaka che Balaba!” Nombe che Balaba ŵaliji jwachiswamba.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Nipele, che Pilato ŵalamwile kuti Che Yesu ajigalikwe, aputikwe mbokola. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Ŵangondo nombe ŵakolosisye chindu mpela singwa ja miiŵa, ŵambwasisye Che Yesu mu ntwe wao ni kuntakusya mwinjilo wa chimwenye. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Ŵaliji nkwaichilila ni kuti, “Tukunkomasya, Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi!” Nipele ŵamputile majanda.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Che Pilato ŵakopweche sooni paasa ni kwasalila Ŵayahudi, “Nnole, ngunyikanawo paasa, mmanyilile kuti uneji nganinansimana ni magambo gagaligose ga kunlamula mundu ju.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵakopweche paasa ali awasile chindu mpela singwa ja miiŵa mu ntwe mwao ni mwinjilo wa chimwenye. Che Pilato ŵasalile Ŵayahudi, “Nnole mundu nsyene ni aju.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakulindilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu paŵambweni Che Yesu ŵanyanyisye, “Mwaŵambe pansalaba! Mwaŵambe pansalaba!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:6">Che Pilato ŵaasalile, “Munjigale mwachinsyene nkaŵambe pansalaba, pakuŵa uneji ngangugawona magambo gagaligose gakunlamula mundu ju.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ŵayahudi ŵajanjile, “Uweji tukwete malajisyo ni kwa malajisyo go ikusachilwa aweje, ligongo alitesile kuŵa Mwana jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Che Pilato paŵagapilikene maloŵe go ŵapundile kogopa. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nipele ŵajinjile sooni mu nyuumba jakwe, ŵambusisye Che Yesu, “Ana mmweji nkutyochela kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:9">Nambo Che Yesu ngananjanga chachili chose. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Che Pilato ŵansalile, “Ana ngankusaka kuŵecheta ni une? Ana ngankumanyilila kuti ngwete ulamusi wa kungopola pane kummamba pansalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Ngankakole ulamusi wauli wose kwa uneji ngankapegwe ni Akunnungu. Kwa ligongo lyo mundu jwambeleche uneji kukwenu jwelejo apundile kuŵa ni sambi syejinji.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Chitandile pelepo, che Pilato ŵasosile litala lya kwalechelela Che Yesu. Nambo Ŵayahudi ŵanyanyisye, “Mwannechelelaga mundu ju, mmwejo nganimma mbusanga jwa mwenye jwa ku Loma, pakuŵa mundu jwalijose jwakulitenda mwenye akunkanila mwenye jwankulu jwa ku Loma!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Nipele che Pilato paŵagapilikene maloŵe go ŵanyichenawo Che Yesu paasa, ni nsyene ŵatemi pa chitengu cha kulamula, pelepo pakuŵilanjikwa, “Luŵala lwa Maganga.” Mchiebulania, Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Lyuŵa lyaliji pamtwe, lyuŵa lyakuŵichila chile Pasaka. Che Pilato ŵaasalile Ŵayahudi, “Mwenye jwenu aju!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ŵanyawo ŵanyanyisye, “Mwaulaje! Mwaulaje! Mwaŵambe pansalaba!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:15">Che Pilato ŵausisye, “Uli, nammambe mwenye jwenu?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:15">Achakulu ŵambopesi ŵajanjile, “Uweji nganitukola mwenye jwine ikaŵe mwenye jwa ku Loma pe!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pelepo che Pilato ŵampeleche Che Yesu mmakono mwa ŵangondo kuti akaaŵambe pansalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Ŵangondo akwaŵamba pansalaba Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Nipele, ŵangondo ŵanjigele Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Che Yesu ŵakopweche ali ajigele nsalaba wakwe kwaula kwiuto kwakukuŵilanjikwa, “Chikalakasa cha Ntwe”, Mchiebulania pakuŵilanjikwa Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Pelepo ni paŵaŵambile Che Yesu, ni ŵandu ŵane ŵaŵili pamo nawo, jwine kunchiji ni jwine kundyo kwao ni Che Yesu pambindikati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Che Pilato ŵalembile chimanyisyo ni ŵachiŵisile pachanya nsalaba. Ni chimanyisyo cho chalembekwe yelei, “Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti, Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Nipele Ŵayahudi ŵajinji ŵachisyomile chimanyisyo cho pakuŵa paŵaŵambile Che Yesu pala paliji chiŵandi ni musi. Sooni chimanyisyo cho chalembekwe Mchiebulania ni Chilatini ni Chigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Nipele achakulu ŵambopesi ŵa Ŵayahudi ŵaasalile che Pilato kuti, “Nkalemba, ‘Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi,’ nambo mundu ju ŵatite, ‘Uneji ndili Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Che Pilato ŵaasalile, “Chilembile, nembile!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ŵangondo paŵamasile kwaŵamba Che Yesu pansalaba, ŵajigele iwalo yao ni ŵagaŵenye maunjili ncheche, jwangondo jwalijose liunjili limo. Sooni ŵajigele mwinjilo wakwe, wanganiukola papatotekwe, waliji chipande chimo chachiluchikwe kutyochela mwinani mpaka paasi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Nipele ŵangondo wo ŵasalilene, “Tunapapulanye nambo tutende gudugudu kuti uwe wacheni.” Yeleyo yatendekwe kuti gamalile Malembelo ga Akunnungu gagakuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Ŵagaŵene iwalo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">ni mwinjilo wangu ŵatendele gudugudu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Yeleyo ni yatite pakupanganya ŵangondo wo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Pachiŵandi ni nsalaba u Che Yesu ŵajimi achikulugwe Che Yesu ni apwao achikulugwe ni che Maliamu ŵankwawo che Kileopa ni che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Che Yesu paŵambweni achikulugwe ni jwakulijiganya juŵannonyele nnope jula ajimi kuŵandikana ni pepala, ŵaasalile achikulugwe, “Amao, jwelejo ni mwanagwenu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Sooni ŵansalile jwakulijiganya jula kuti, “Nnole, jwelejo ni achikulu ŵenu.” Ni kutandila lyuŵa lyo jwakulijiganya jo ŵanjigele che Maliamu kuti akatame nawo kumangwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Che Yesu ŵaimanyilile kuti yose yaliji imalile, ni Malembelo ga Akunnungu kuti gamalile, ŵatite, “Jingwete njota.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Chapali kweleko chiŵiga chigumbele divai jakuipa. Nipele, ŵajigele chindu mpela lidodoki ni ŵatoŵele mu divai mo ni kutaŵilila pachitela chachikuŵilanjikwa esopo ni kuchiŵika pakang'wa pa Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kupegwa divai jo, ŵatite, “Yose imalile!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:30">Ni ŵakotamisye ntwe wao ni kwasika.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo akunsoma Che Yesu ni mpaamba pa luŵalati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Lyaliji lyuŵa lya kuŵichila chile kwa kupumulila likanaŵe Lyuŵa lya Pasaka. Nipele achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi nganasaka iilu itaame pa nsalaba pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila ligongo Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila lyaliji lyuŵa lyajikape. Kwapele ŵaŵendile che Pilato apokosole makongolo ga ŵele ŵaŵaŵambikwe pa nsalaba ni kuitulusya iilu yao. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Nipele ŵangondo ŵajawile ni kugapokosola makongolo ga mundu jwaandanda ni jwaaŵili ŵaŵaliji aŵambikwe pansalaba pamo ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Nambo paŵaichilile Che Yesu, ŵaiweni kuti awile, kwapele nganagapokosola makongolo gao. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nambo jwangondo jumo ŵansomile Che Yesu mpaamba pa luŵalati, ni papopo jakopweche miasi ni meesi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Nombe juŵaiweni yeleyo ilinkutendekwa aŵalasile umboni melepe ni ŵanyamwe nkombole kukulupilila. Ni umboni wasasile uli usyene, sooni jwelejo akumanyilila kuti akusala usyene. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Yelei yatendekwe kuti gamalile Malembelo ga Akunnungu gagakuti, “Ngapagwa liupa lyao lichilipokoswe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Nipele Malembelo ga Akunnungu gakusala sooni, “Chiŵalole ŵeŵala ŵaŵansomile.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiilu chi Che Yesu chikuŵichikwa mwilembe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Payamasile yeleyo che Yusufu jwa ku Alimataya, ŵaŵendile che Pilato kuti achitulusye chiilu chi Che Yesu pa nsalaba. Che Yusufu ŵaliji jwakulijiganya jwao Che Yesu, nambo nganalilosyaga, pakuŵa ŵajogopaga achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi. Nipele che Pilato ŵajitichisye. Che Yusufu ŵajawile ni kuchijigala chiilu chi Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Che Yusufu ŵalongene ni che Nikodemu, che Nikodemu ju ni jwejula juŵajaulile Che Yesu chilo kundanda ko, ŵaiche ali ajigele mauta gakununjila yambone ga manemane kuwanganya ni ubani, mpela mbiisi saba ni ibaba iŵili. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Nipele ŵachijigele chiilu chi Che Yesu ni kuchiŵijilila mu nguo jeswela pamo ni yakununjila mpela chisyoŵelo cha Ŵayahudi katema ka kusika. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Nambo peuto paŵaŵambikwe Che Yesu pala wapali ngunda wa mwana, ni mu ngunda mo mwaliji mwana lilembe lya sambano mwakanaŵichikwa mundu jwalijose. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Nipele ligongo lyaliji lyuŵa lya Ŵayahudi kuliŵika chile kupumulila, ni sooni pakuŵa lilembe lyo lyaliji pachiŵandi, ŵachiŵisile chiilu chi Che Yesu mwelemo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu asyuchile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Kundaŵi pe kukanaŵe kucha, lyuŵa lyaandanda lya chijuma pakumala Lyuŵa lya kupumulila, che Maliamu jwa ku Magidala ŵajawile ku lilembe, ni ŵaliŵeni liganga lila lili lyegalambule pambali kutyochela pakwinjilila mwilembe. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Nipele, ŵautuchile ku che Simoni Petulo ni ajula jwakulijiganya jwine juŵanonyelwe nnope ni Che Yesu ni kwasalila, “Achikopwesye chiilu cha Ambuje mwilembe mula, ni sooni ngatukukumanyilila kwapi ambisile.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Che Petulo pamo ni jwakulijiganya jwine jula ŵajawile ku lilembe. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵautwiche nambo jwakulijiganya jwine jula jwampundile che Petulo, jwaliji jwaandanda kwika ku lilembe. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Paŵakoteme ni kulingulila, ŵasiweni nguo syeswela pe, nambo nganajinjila. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Nipele, che Simoni Petulo nombejo ŵaiche achakuyaga, ŵajinjile mwilembe ni ŵasiweni nguo syeswela sisyaŵijilile chiilu chi Che Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ni chiguo chiŵammijilile Che Yesu mu ntwe. Chiguo chila nganichiŵa pamo ni nguo syeswela sila, nambo chaliji chepinde ni chaliji pajika. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Pelepo jwakulijiganya jwine juŵalongolele kwika ku lilembe jula, nombejo ŵajinjile nkati, ni ŵaiweni ni kukulupilila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Ŵaliji nganaŵe kugamanya Malembelo ga Akunnungu gagakuti Che Yesu akusachilwa asyuche. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya wo ŵausile kumangwao.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulilosya ku che Maliamu jwa ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Che Maliamu ŵajimi paasa lilembe, achililaga. Paŵalilaga, ŵakoteme achilingulilaga mwilembe mula, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />ni ŵaweni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵaŵili ŵaŵawasile iwalo yeswela, atemi paŵachigoneche chiilu chi Che Yesu pala jumo kuntwe ni jwine ku makongolo. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani wo ŵambusisye, “Amao, nkulila ichichi?” Ni ŵajanjile, “Achikopwesye chiilu cha Ambuje ŵangu, ni sooni ngangukumanyilila kwapi achiŵisile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Nipele che Maliamu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo, ŵagalawiche panyuma ni kwaona Che Yesu ali ajimi pelepo, nambo nganaimanyilila kuti jwelejo ali Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Che Yesu ŵambusisye, “Amao, ana nkulilila ichichi? Ana nkwasosa ŵaani?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 20:15">Che Maliamu akuno achiganisyaga kuti akukunguluka ni jwakuugosa ngunda wa mwana, ŵajanjile, “Achimwene, iŵaga mmwejo nchijigele chiilu chi Che Yesu, musalile kunchiŵisile ni uneji chingachijigale.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Che Maliamu!” Ni che Maliamu ŵagalawiche panyuma, ni kwasalila Mchiebulania, “Laboni!” Malumbo gakwe “Jwakwiganya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Nkangamula, pakuŵa ngunaŵe kwaula kwa Atati. Nambo njaule kwa achalongo achinjangu nkaasalile kuti, ngwaula kwa Atati ŵangu ŵaali Atati ŵenu, Akunnungu ŵangu ŵaali Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Nipele che Maliamu jwa ku Magidala ŵajawile kukwasalila ŵakulijiganya kuti, ŵaweni Ambuje ni ŵaasalile achila chiŵasalilwe ni Che Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakopochela ŵakulijiganya ŵao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Lyaliji ligulo lya lyuŵa lyaandanda lya chijuma pakumala Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵasongangene pamo mu nyuumba ni minango jaliji jeugale ligongo lya kwajogopa achakulu ŵa Ŵayahudi. Pelepo ŵaiche Che Yesu ni kwima pasikati jao ni kwasalila, “Chitendewele kukwenu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo, Che Yesu ŵalosisye makono gao ni luŵalati lwao. Nipele ŵakulijiganya wo ŵasengwile nnope kwawona Ambuje. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile sooni, “Chitendewele kukwenu! Mpela ila Atati iŵandumile une, ni uneji nguntuma ŵanyamwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo ŵapepelele ni kwasalila, “Mumpochele Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mwalechelesyaga ŵandu sambi syao, ŵele ŵandu chalecheleswe, ni aŵala ŵangankwalechelesya, ŵele ŵandu ngalecheleswa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukunguluka ni che Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Che Tomasi jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵala, jwakuŵilanjikwa maŵila, nganaŵa pamo ni achinjakwe paŵaiche Che Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵala ŵansalile, “Twaweni Ambuje.” Che Tomasi ŵaasalile, “Chingulupilile pachinagawone maŵasi ga misumali ni kuchiŵika chala changu pa maŵasi go ni kuuŵika nkono wangu pa luŵalati lwao.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Nipele pagapite moŵa nsano ni gatatu ŵakulijiganya wo ŵasongangene sooni nkati mula ni che Tomasi ŵaliji pamo nawo. Minango jaliji jeugale, ni Che Yesu ŵaiche ni kwima pasikati jao ni kuti, “Chitendewele kukwenu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile che Tomasi, “Mbiche chala chenu pelepa nnole magasa gangu ni njisenawo nkono wenu mbiche pa luŵalati lwangu. Nkakola lipamba nambo nkulupilile!” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Che Tomasi ŵajanjile, “Mmwe ndi Ambuje ŵangu ni mmwe ndi Akunnungu ŵangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Ana nkukulupilila ligongo muuweni? Akwete upile ŵelewo ŵakukulupilila pangamona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nningwa wa chitabu chi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Che Yesu ŵapanganyisye imanyisyo ine yejinji paŵaliji ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao yanganiilembekwe mchitabu chi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Nambo ayiyi ilembekwe nkole kukulupilila kuti Che Yesu ali Kilisito Jwakuwombola, Mwana jwa Akunnungu ni kwa kunkulupilila nkole umi wausyene kwa machili ga liina lyao.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakopochela ŵakulijiganya ŵao nsano ni ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Payamasile yeleyo, Che Yesu ŵaakopochele sooni ŵakulijiganya ŵao mungulugulu litanda lya Tibelia. Ni ŵalilosisye kwanti yelei, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Che Simoni Petulo ni che Tomasi jwakuŵilanjikwa maŵila ni che Nasanieli jwa ku Kana ja ku Galilaya ni ŵanache ŵa che Sebedayo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵane ŵaŵili, wose ŵaliji pamo. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Che Simoni Petulo ŵaasalile achinjakwe, “Ngwaula kukukoka somba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Ni ŵanyawo nombe ŵansalile, “Noweji tutulongane nomwe.” Nipele ŵatyosile ni ŵakwesile ngalaŵa nambo chilo chila chose nganapatanga chachili chose. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kundaŵi pe, Che Yesu ŵajimi mungulugulu litanda nambo ŵakulijiganya nganamanyililaga kuti ŵaliji ŵelewo. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Achachanda, ana nganimpate somba syasilisyose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Elo, nganitupate somba.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Mponye lwau kundyo kwa ngalaŵa chimpate somba.” Nipele ŵaponyisye lwau ni sambano nganakombolanga kulukwekwelemya ligongo somba syaliji syesijinji nnope.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Pelepo jwakulijiganya juŵanonyelwe nnope ni Che Yesu jula ŵansalile che Petulo, “Ambuje ŵelewo!” Palapala che Simoni Petulo paŵapilikene kuti Ambuje, ŵatakwile mwinjilo wao ligongo ŵaliji ausile ni kuliponyela mmeesi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵala ŵaiche ku mbwani ni ngalaŵa ali nkulukwekwelemya lwau lwalugumbele somba pakuŵa nganatalichila kunsanga, mpela makongolo mia moja. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Paŵaiche kunsanga ŵauweni mooto wa makala ni pachanya pakwe paŵichikwe somba ni nkate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Muumbe somba simpepe simpatile sampano.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Nipele che Simoni Petulo ŵakwesile mu ngalaŵa, ŵaluwutile kunsanga lwau lwalugumbele somba syekulungwa mia moja na hansini na tatu. Namuno somba syo syaliji syesijinji kwanti yele, lwau nganilupapuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Njisangane kunlye.” Nganapagwa namose jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao juŵalinjile kumbusya, “Ana mmwe ndi ŵaani,” pakuŵa ŵamanyilile kuti ali Ambuje. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Che Yesu ŵaiche, ŵajigele nkate ni kwapa. Ŵatesile iyoyo peyo ni somba sila.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Keleka kaliji kaatatu Che Yesu kwakopochela ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵamasile kusyuka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni che Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Paŵamasile kulya, Che Yesu ŵambusisye che Simoni Petulo, “Che Simoni mwanagwao che Yohana! Ana nkuunonyela une kwapunda ŵane wa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Elo, Ambuje, nnyimanyi kuti uneji ngunnonyela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Nsigose ngondolo syangu sya mwana.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Nipele ŵambusisye sooni kaaŵili, “Che Simoni mwanagwao che Yohana! Ana nkuunonyela une?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Che Petulo wajanjile, “Elo, Ambuje, nnyimanyi kuti ngunnonyela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Nsigose ngondolo syangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Nipele ŵambusisye sooni kaatatu kuti, “Che Simoni mwanagwao che Yohana! Ana nkuunonyela une?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pelepo che Petulo ŵalilasiche muntima pakuŵa ŵausisye kaatatu, “Nkuunonyela?” Ni ŵajanjile, “Ambuje, mmwe nnyimanyi yose, mmwe nnyimanyi kuti uneji ngunnonyela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Nsigose ngondolo syangu! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ngunsalila isyene, pamwaliji jwanchanda, mwasyoŵelele kulitaŵa mpumbulu mwasyene ni kwaula kwakulikose kumwasachile kwaula. Nambo pachinchekulupe, chinchijongola makono genu ni mundu jwine chachintaŵa ni kunjausya kungankukusaka kwaula.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwakuŵecheta yeleyo, Che Yesu ŵalosisye chiwa chichawe che Petulo ni kwapa ukulu Akunnungu. Paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo ŵansalile, “Munguye.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pelepo che Petulo ŵagalawiche ni kumbona jwakulijiganya juŵanonyelwe nnope ni Che Yesu achakuyaga. Jwakulijiganya ju ni jwejula juŵatemi kuŵandikana nnope ni Che Yesu katema ka chakulya cha Pasaka ni kwausya Che Yesu, “Ambuje ana nduni juchangalauche?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Che Petulo paŵambweni jwelejo ŵambusisye Che Yesu, “Ambuje, nambi jwelejo chiyasimane ichichi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nasakaga asigale mpaka pachimuje ana mmwe ikumbandichila chichi? Mmwejo munguye une.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Nipele ngani jo jajenele kwa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito kuti jwakulijiganya jo ngaawa. Nambo Che Yesu nganasala kuti ngaawa, nambo ŵatite, “Nasakaga asigale mpaka pachimuje ana mmwe ikumbandichila chichi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Jwakulijiganya ju ni jwejula jwaŵalasile umboni wa indu yi ni kulemba. Uweji tukumanyilila kuti yasasile ili isyene.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maloŵe ga kumalichisya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Ipali indu ine yejinji iŵaitendekenye Che Yesu. Yeleyo ikalembekwe yose chimo chimo nguganisya kuti namose chilambo chose ngachikajenele kuŵika itabu yaikalembekwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>